window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/a413-414014240a32fdf2.json"]={sha256:"414014240a32fdf2b56850910b265ff2a6a902efb7cb4d7f64df315af29297d9",value:{"id":"a413","title":"增透膜設計與沉積","titleEn":"Antireflection coating design and deposition","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"從 Fresnel 反射與多片鏡頭的穿透率損失出發，用導納匹配條件推導 MgF₂ 單層、四分之一波雙層 V 膜與四分之一／半波／四分之一寬帶膜的殘餘反射率，再討論低折射率膜材與熱基板蒸鍍、透鏡上的厚度分佈、低反射率量測的背面陷阱、入射角與偏振的影響，最後把殘餘反射換算成鏡頭鬼影與穿透率預算並完成驗收交接。","summaryEn":"Starting from Fresnel reflection and the transmission loss of multi-element lenses, derive the residual reflectance of a MgF₂ single layer, a quarter-quarter V-coat and a quarter-half-quarter broadband design from the admittance-matching condition, then cover low-index materials and hot-substrate evaporation, thickness distribution on lenses, the back-surface trap in low-reflectance metrology, incidence-angle and polarization effects, and finally convert residual reflectance into lens ghost and transmission budgets for acceptance handoff.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-coatings-elements","subcategoryTitle":"薄膜、繞射與微結構光學元件","subcategoryTitleEn":"Coatings, diffractive and structured optical elements","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-coatings-elements","learningTags":["optics","optics-coatings-elements","coating"],"architectureFamily":"coating","architectureNodes":[["導納圖設計（V 膜／寬帶）","Admittance-diagram design (V-coat/broadband)"],["低折射率膜材 MgF₂ 與 SiO₂","Low-index materials MgF₂ and SiO₂"],["熱基板與離子輔助蒸鍍","Hot-substrate and ion-assisted evaporation"],["透鏡夾具與厚度分佈","Lens fixture and thickness distribution"],["反射率量測與背面處理","Reflectance metrology and back-surface handling"],["鏡頭鬼影預算與驗收","Lens ghost budget and acceptance"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[4,0],[4,5]],"diagram":{"type":"coating","labels":["導納圖設計（V 膜／寬帶）","低折射率膜材 MgF₂ 與 SiO₂","熱基板與離子輔助蒸鍍","透鏡夾具與厚度分佈","反射率量測與背面處理"],"labelsEn":["Admittance-diagram design (V-coat/broadband)","Low-index materials MgF₂ and SiO₂","Hot-substrate and ion-assisted evaporation","Lens fixture and thickness distribution","Reflectance metrology and back-surface handling"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"增透膜設計與整合練習：BK7（n_s = 1.52）透鏡，工作波段 450 到 650 nm，主光線入射角 0 到 30°。先評估單層 MgF₂：R(550) = [(1.52 − 1.38²)/(1.52 + 1.38²)]² = [(1.52 − 1.904)/3.424]² ≈ 0.0126，400 到 700 nm 平均 1.48%，不符 0.5% 的要求。改用四分之一／半波／四分之一設計（520 nm）：MgF₂ 94.2 nm、ZrO₂ 126.8 nm、Al₂O₃ 79.8 nm，矩陣計算 400 到 700 nm 平均 0.20%，30° 時 0.31%，仍在 0.5% 內。二十面中十六面以此膜計 0.25%、四面陡峭面計 0.5%，鏡頭穿透率 ≈ 0.9975¹⁶ × 0.995⁴ × 0.98 ≈ 0.92，最亮雙面鬼影 0.005² = 2.5×10⁻⁵。製程公差：蒙地卡羅各層 ±3% 厚度擾動一千次後平均反射率落在 0.19% 到 0.28%，良率 100%；邊緣傾角 30° 的面厚度薄 13%，需把夾具傾斜或把設計中心上移 5% 補償。數值皆為教學假設，不代表任何產品規格。","textEn":"Antireflection design and integration exercise: a BK7 lens (n_s = 1.52) working from 450 to 650 nm with chief-ray incidence from 0 to 30°. First evaluate single-layer MgF₂: R(550) = [(1.52 − 1.38²)/(1.52 + 1.38²)]² = [(1.52 − 1.904)/3.424]² ≈ 0.0126 and a 400 to 700 nm average of 1.48%, failing the 0.5% requirement. Switch to a quarter-half-quarter design at 520 nm: MgF₂ 94.2 nm, ZrO₂ 126.8 nm, Al₂O₃ 79.8 nm; the matrix calculation gives a 400 to 700 nm average of 0.20% and 0.31% at 30°, still within 0.5%. Counting sixteen of twenty surfaces at 0.25% and four steep surfaces at 0.5%, lens transmission ≈ 0.9975¹⁶ × 0.995⁴ × 0.98 ≈ 0.92 and the brightest two-surface ghost is 0.005² = 2.5×10⁻⁵. Process tolerance: a thousand-trial Monte-Carlo run with ±3% thickness perturbation per layer keeps the average reflectance between 0.19% and 0.28%, full yield; a surface with a 30° rim tilt receives 13% less thickness and needs a tilted fixture or a 5% upward bias of the design centre to compensate. All values are teaching assumptions, not any product specification.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a413-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「Fresnel 反射、穿透率損失與鬼影」與「導納匹配：單層與 V 形增透膜」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Fresnel reflection, transmission loss and ghost images\" and \"Admittance matching: single-layer and V-coat designs\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a413-v12-01","title":"Fresnel 反射、穿透率損失與鬼影：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Fresnel reflection, transmission loss and ghost images: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「多片鏡頭的二十個空氣界面」如何決定增透膜設計與沉積的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Twenty air-glass interfaces of a multi-element lens” determines the key performance of “Antireflection coating design and deposition”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"每個空氣與玻璃的界面在正向入射時依 Fresnel 公式反射 [(n − 1)/(n + 1)]² 的能量，BK7 約 4.3%。一支十片透鏡的鏡頭有二十個這樣的界面，未鍍膜時穿透率只剩四成，而且任意兩個界面反射的光會再度抵達像面形成鬼影，其強度正比於兩個反射率的乘積。增透膜的任務就是把每個界面的反射率壓到千分之幾，使穿透率回到九成以上，並把鬼影強度降低兩個數量級；因此增透膜的規格必須從系統的穿透率與雜散光預算倒推，而不是單獨追求某一波長的零反射。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「多片鏡頭的二十個空氣界面」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"At normal incidence each air-glass interface reflects a fraction [(n − 1)/(n + 1)]² of the energy by the Fresnel equations, about 4.3% for BK7. A ten-element lens has twenty such interfaces, so uncoated it transmits only about forty percent, and light reflected by any two interfaces reaches the image again as a ghost whose intensity scales with the product of the two reflectances. The job of an antireflection film is to push each interface to a few tenths of a percent, restoring transmission above ninety percent and cutting ghost intensity by two orders of magnitude; the coating specification therefore follows from the system's transmission and stray-light budget rather than from zero reflectance at one wavelength. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Twenty air-glass interfaces of a multi-element lens”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：BK7 單界面 R = [(1.52 − 1)/(1.52 + 1)]² ≈ 0.0426。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A single BK7 interface has R = [(1.52 − 1)/(1.52 + 1)]² ≈ 0.0426.","failure":"常見誤解：「一片鏡片只損失 4%，所以整支鏡頭不鍍膜也只差幾個百分點。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"One element loses only 4%, so an uncoated lens is only a few percent worse overall.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「多片鏡頭的二十個空氣界面」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Twenty air-glass interfaces of a multi-element lens”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-01-k1","title":"Fresnel 反射、穿透率損失與鬼影","titleEn":"Fresnel reflection, transmission loss and ghost images","text":"每個空氣與玻璃的界面在正向入射時依 Fresnel 公式反射 [(n − 1)/(n + 1)]² 的能量，BK7 約 4.3%。一支十片透鏡的鏡頭有二十個這樣的界面，未鍍膜時穿透率只剩四成，而且任意兩個界面反射的光會再度抵達像面形成鬼影，其強度正比於兩個反射率的乘積。","textEn":"At normal incidence each air-glass interface reflects a fraction [(n − 1)/(n + 1)]² of the energy by the Fresnel equations, about 4.3% for BK7. A ten-element lens has twenty such interfaces, so uncoated it transmits only about forty percent, and light reflected by any two interfaces reaches the image again as a ghost whose intensity scales with the product of the two reflectances.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：一片鏡片只損失 4%，所以整支鏡頭不鍍膜也只差幾個百分點。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: One element loses only 4%, so an uncoated lens is only a few percent worse overall. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「Fresnel 反射、穿透率損失與鬼影」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Fresnel reflection, transmission loss and ghost images\" is correct?","options":["一片鏡片只損失 4%，所以整支鏡頭不鍍膜也只差幾個百分點。","每個空氣與玻璃的界面在正向入射時依 Fresnel 公式反射 [(n − 1)/(n + 1)]² 的能量，BK7 約 4.3%。","增透膜就是鍍一層折射率低於玻璃的材料，越低越好，厚度不重要。"],"optionsEn":["One element loses only 4%, so an uncoated lens is only a few percent worse overall.","At normal incidence each air-glass interface reflects a fraction [(n − 1)/(n + 1)]² of the energy by the Fresnel equations, about 4.3% for BK7.","An antireflection film is just a layer of index lower than glass, the lower the better, with thickness unimportant."],"answer":1,"explanation":"每個空氣與玻璃的界面在正向入射時依 Fresnel 公式反射 [(n − 1)/(n + 1)]² 的能量，BK7 約 4.3%。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"At normal incidence each air-glass interface reflects a fraction [(n − 1)/(n + 1)]² of the energy by the Fresnel equations, about 4.3% for BK7. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a413-v12-02","title":"Fresnel 反射、穿透率損失與鬼影：定量估算","titleEn":"Fresnel reflection, transmission loss and ghost images: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「多片鏡頭的二十個空氣界面」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Twenty air-glass interfaces of a multi-element lens” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：BK7 單界面 R = [(1.52 − 1)/(1.52 + 1)]² ≈ 0.0426。二十個界面：未鍍膜穿透率 0.9574²⁰ ≈ 0.42；每面 0.5% 時 0.995²⁰ ≈ 0.905；每面 0.2% 時 0.998²⁰ ≈ 0.961。雙面鬼影相對強度 ≈ R₁·R₂：未鍍膜 0.0426² ≈ 1.8×10⁻³，鍍 0.5% 增透膜後 0.005² = 2.5×10⁻⁵，下降約 72 倍。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A single BK7 interface has R = [(1.52 − 1)/(1.52 + 1)]² ≈ 0.0426. For twenty interfaces the uncoated transmission is 0.9574²⁰ ≈ 0.42; at 0.5% per surface 0.995²⁰ ≈ 0.905; at 0.2% per surface 0.998²⁰ ≈ 0.961. The relative intensity of a two-surface ghost ≈ R₁·R₂: uncoated 0.0426² ≈ 1.8×10⁻³, with 0.5% antireflection 0.005² = 2.5×10⁻⁵, about 72 times lower. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用積分球或準直光束量整支鏡頭在工作波段的穿透率，與每面反射率的乘積模型比較；把鏡頭對準點光源拍攝，量測鬼影相對亮度並用光線追跡的鬼影分析辨認是哪一對面，核對其乘積是否與量到的亮度一致。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the whole lens's in-band transmission with an integrating sphere or a collimated beam and compare with the product-of-surfaces model; photograph a point source through the lens, measure relative ghost brightness and identify the responsible surface pair with ray-trace ghost analysis, checking that the product of their reflectances matches the measured brightness.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"BK7 單界面 R = [(1.52 − 1)/(1.52 + 1)]² ≈ 0.0426。二十個界面：未鍍膜穿透率 0.9574²⁰ ≈ 0.42；每面 0.5% 時 0.995²⁰ ≈ 0.905；每面 0.2% 時 0.998²⁰ ≈ 0.961。雙面鬼影相對強度 ≈ R₁·R₂：未鍍膜 0.0426² ≈ 1.8×10⁻³，鍍 0.5% 增透膜後 0.005² = 2.5×10⁻⁵，下降約 72 倍。","textEn":"A single BK7 interface has R = [(1.52 − 1)/(1.52 + 1)]² ≈ 0.0426. For twenty interfaces the uncoated transmission is 0.9574²⁰ ≈ 0.42; at 0.5% per surface 0.995²⁰ ≈ 0.905; at 0.2% per surface 0.998²⁰ ≈ 0.961. The relative intensity of a two-surface ghost ≈ R₁·R₂: uncoated 0.0426² ≈ 1.8×10⁻³, with 0.5% antireflection 0.005² = 2.5×10⁻⁵, about 72 times lower.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「Fresnel 反射、穿透率損失與鬼影」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Fresnel reflection, transmission loss and ghost images\", which statement holds?","options":["同一種膜材無論怎麼鍍，折射率與耐久性都一樣。","增透膜對入射角不敏感，正向量測合格就能用在任何角度。","BK7 單界面 R = [(1.52 − 1)/(1.52 + 1)]² ≈ 0.0426。"],"optionsEn":["A given material has the same index and durability however it is deposited.","Antireflection films are insensitive to incidence angle, so passing at normal incidence qualifies any angle.","A single BK7 interface has R = [(1.52 − 1)/(1.52 + 1)]² ≈ 0.0426."],"answer":2,"explanation":"BK7 單界面 R = [(1.52 − 1)/(1.52 + 1)]² ≈ 0.0426。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A single BK7 interface has R = [(1.52 − 1)/(1.52 + 1)]² ≈ 0.0426. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a413-v12-03","title":"Fresnel 反射、穿透率損失與鬼影：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Fresnel reflection, transmission loss and ghost images: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「多片鏡頭的二十個空氣界面」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Twenty air-glass interfaces of a multi-element lens” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用積分球或準直光束量整支鏡頭在工作波段的穿透率，與每面反射率的乘積模型比較；把鏡頭對準點光源拍攝，量測鬼影相對亮度並用光線追跡的鬼影分析辨認是哪一對面，核對其乘積是否與量到的亮度一致。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the whole lens's in-band transmission with an integrating sphere or a collimated beam and compare with the product-of-surfaces model; photograph a point source through the lens, measure relative ghost brightness and identify the responsible surface pair with ray-trace ghost analysis, checking that the product of their reflectances matches the measured brightness. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：只在 550 nm 要求零反射而忽略 450 nm 與 650 nm 的殘餘反射，鏡頭在白光下出現帶紫紅色的鬼影與偏色的穿透率，影像對比在藍與紅端下降。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Demanding zero reflectance at 550 nm while ignoring the residual at 450 and 650 nm produces purple-tinted ghosts and a colour-biased transmission under white light, lowering contrast at the blue and red ends.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用積分球或準直光束量整支鏡頭在工作波段的穿透率，與每面反射率的乘積模型比較；把鏡頭對準點光源拍攝，量測鬼影相對亮度並用光線追跡的鬼影分析辨認是哪一對面，核對其乘積是否與量到的亮度一致。","textEn":"Measure the whole lens's in-band transmission with an integrating sphere or a collimated beam and compare with the product-of-surfaces model; photograph a point source through the lens, measure relative ghost brightness and identify the responsible surface pair with ray-trace ghost analysis, checking that the product of their reflectances matches the measured brightness.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「Fresnel 反射、穿透率損失與鬼影」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Fresnel reflection, transmission loss and ghost images\"?","options":["用積分球或準直光束量整支鏡頭在工作波段的穿透率，與每面反射率的乘積模型比較。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","透鏡在腔內轉動，膜厚在整個曲面上自然均勻。"],"optionsEn":["Measure the whole lens's in-band transmission with an integrating sphere or a collimated beam and compare with the product-of-surfaces model.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Because the lens rotates in the chamber the film is naturally uniform over the whole curved surface."],"answer":0,"explanation":"用積分球或準直光束量整支鏡頭在工作波段的穿透率，與每面反射率的乘積模型比較；把鏡頭對準點光源拍攝，量測鬼影相對亮度並用光線追跡的鬼影分析辨認是哪一對面，核對其乘積是否與量到的亮度一致。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the whole lens's in-band transmission with an integrating sphere or a collimated beam and compare with the product-of-surfaces model; photograph a point source through the lens, measure relative ghost brightness and identify the responsible surface pair with ray-trace ghost analysis, checking that the product of their reflectances matches the measured brightness. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a413-v12-04","title":"Fresnel 反射、穿透率損失與鬼影：失效診斷","titleEn":"Fresnel reflection, transmission loss and ghost images: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「多片鏡頭的二十個空氣界面」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Twenty air-glass interfaces of a multi-element lens” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"只在 550 nm 要求零反射而忽略 450 nm 與 650 nm 的殘餘反射，鏡頭在白光下出現帶紫紅色的鬼影與偏色的穿透率，影像對比在藍與紅端下降。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Demanding zero reflectance at 550 nm while ignoring the residual at 450 and 650 nm produces purple-tinted ghosts and a colour-biased transmission under white light, lowering contrast at the blue and red ends. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：增透膜的任務就是把每個界面的反射率壓到千分之幾，使穿透率回到九成以上，並把鬼影強度降低兩個數量級；因此增透膜的規格必須從系統的穿透率與雜散光預算倒推，而不是單獨追求某一波長的零反射。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The job of an antireflection film is to push each interface to a few tenths of a percent, restoring transmission above ninety percent and cutting ghost intensity by two orders of magnitude; the coating specification therefore follows from the system's transmission and stray-light budget rather than from zero reflectance at one wavelength.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「一片鏡片只損失 4%，所以整支鏡頭不鍍膜也只差幾個百分點。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"One element loses only 4%, so an uncoated lens is only a few percent worse overall.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只在 550 nm 要求零反射而忽略 450 nm 與 650 nm 的殘餘反射，鏡頭在白光下出現帶紫紅色的鬼影與偏色的穿透率，影像對比在藍與紅端下降。","textEn":"Demanding zero reflectance at 550 nm while ignoring the residual at 450 and 650 nm produces purple-tinted ghosts and a colour-biased transmission under white light, lowering contrast at the blue and red ends.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「Fresnel 反射、穿透率損失與鬼影」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Fresnel reflection, transmission loss and ghost images\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","只在 550 nm 要求零反射而忽略 450 nm 與 650 nm 的殘餘反射，鏡頭在白光下出現帶紫紅色的鬼影與偏色的穿透率，影像對比在藍與紅端下降。","增透膜就是鍍一層折射率低於玻璃的材料，越低越好，厚度不重要。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Demanding zero reflectance at 550 nm while ignoring the residual at 450 and 650 nm produces purple-tinted ghosts and a colour-biased transmission under white light, lowering contrast at the blue and red ends.","An antireflection film is just a layer of index lower than glass, the lower the better, with thickness unimportant."],"answer":1,"explanation":"只在 550 nm 要求零反射而忽略 450 nm 與 650 nm 的殘餘反射，鏡頭在白光下出現帶紫紅色的鬼影與偏色的穿透率，影像對比在藍與紅端下降。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Demanding zero reflectance at 550 nm while ignoring the residual at 450 and 650 nm produces purple-tinted ghosts and a colour-biased transmission under white light, lowering contrast at the blue and red ends. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a413-v12-05","title":"導納匹配：單層與 V 形增透膜：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Admittance matching: single-layer and V-coat designs: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「MgF₂ 單層與四分之一波雙層 V 膜」如何決定增透膜設計與沉積的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “MgF₂ single layer and quarter-quarter V-coat” determines the key performance of “Antireflection coating design and deposition”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"增透的條件是讓膜系在入射側的等效導納等於入射介質的折射率。四分之一波單層把基板導納 n_s 轉成 n₁²/n_s，要完全匹配空氣需要 n₁ = √n_s，對 BK7 是 1.23，沒有這麼低的緻密材料，最接近的 MgF₂（1.38）只能把反射率降到 1.3%。雙層四分之一波設計用內層的高折射率把基板導納先抬高、再由外層 MgF₂ 拉回 1，條件是 n₂/n₁ = √n_s；這種設計在單一波長達到近零反射而兩側迅速上升，光譜呈 V 形，因此稱為 V 膜，適合雷射線寬的應用。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「MgF₂ 單層與四分之一波雙層 V 膜」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The antireflection condition is that the stack's equivalent admittance on the incident side equals the index of the incident medium. A quarter-wave single layer transforms the substrate admittance n_s into n₁²/n_s, so matching air requires n₁ = √n_s, about 1.23 for BK7; no dense material is that low, and the closest, MgF₂ at 1.38, only brings reflectance down to 1.3%. A two-layer quarter-quarter design uses a higher-index inner layer to raise the substrate admittance first and the outer MgF₂ layer to bring it back to 1, with the condition n₂/n₁ = √n_s; it reaches near-zero reflectance at one wavelength and rises quickly on both sides, giving the V-shaped spectrum that names the V-coat and suits laser-line applications. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “MgF₂ single layer and quarter-quarter V-coat”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：單層四分之一波 MgF₂ 於 BK7：R = [(n_s − n₁²)/(n_s + n₁²)]² = [(1.52 − 1.904)/(1.52 + 1.904)]² ≈ 0.0126。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A quarter-wave MgF₂ single layer on BK7: R = [(n_s − n₁²)/(n_s + n₁²)]² = [(1.52 − 1.904)/(1.52 + 1.904)]² ≈ 0.0126.","failure":"常見誤解：「增透膜就是鍍一層折射率低於玻璃的材料，越低越好，厚度不重要。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"An antireflection film is just a layer of index lower than glass, the lower the better, with thickness unimportant.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「MgF₂ 單層與四分之一波雙層 V 膜」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “MgF₂ single layer and quarter-quarter V-coat”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-05-k1","title":"導納匹配：單層與 V 形增透膜","titleEn":"Admittance matching: single-layer and V-coat designs","text":"增透的條件是讓膜系在入射側的等效導納等於入射介質的折射率。四分之一波單層把基板導納 n_s 轉成 n₁²/n_s，要完全匹配空氣需要 n₁ = √n_s，對 BK7 是 1.23，沒有這麼低的緻密材料，最接近的 MgF₂（1.38）只能把反射率降到 1.3%。","textEn":"The antireflection condition is that the stack's equivalent admittance on the incident side equals the index of the incident medium. A quarter-wave single layer transforms the substrate admittance n_s into n₁²/n_s, so matching air requires n₁ = √n_s, about 1.23 for BK7; no dense material is that low, and the closest, MgF₂ at 1.38, only brings reflectance down to 1.3%.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：增透膜就是鍍一層折射率低於玻璃的材料，越低越好，厚度不重要。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: An antireflection film is just a layer of index lower than glass, the lower the better, with thickness unimportant. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「導納匹配：單層與 V 形增透膜」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Admittance matching: single-layer and V-coat designs\" is correct?","options":["增透膜就是鍍一層折射率低於玻璃的材料，越低越好，厚度不重要。","半波層對設計波長沒有作用，所以寬帶膜裡的半波層可以省略。","增透的條件是讓膜系在入射側的等效導納等於入射介質的折射率。"],"optionsEn":["An antireflection film is just a layer of index lower than glass, the lower the better, with thickness unimportant.","A half-wave layer does nothing at the design wavelength, so it can be dropped from a broadband design.","The antireflection condition is that the stack's equivalent admittance on the incident side equals the index of the incident medium."],"answer":2,"explanation":"增透的條件是讓膜系在入射側的等效導納等於入射介質的折射率。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The antireflection condition is that the stack's equivalent admittance on the incident side equals the index of the incident medium. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a413-v12-06","title":"導納匹配：單層與 V 形增透膜：定量估算","titleEn":"Admittance matching: single-layer and V-coat designs: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「MgF₂ 單層與四分之一波雙層 V 膜」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “MgF₂ single layer and quarter-quarter V-coat” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：單層四分之一波 MgF₂ 於 BK7：R = [(n_s − n₁²)/(n_s + n₁²)]² = [(1.52 − 1.904)/(1.52 + 1.904)]² ≈ 0.0126。雙層 MgF₂/Al₂O₃（1.38/1.63）：Y = n₁²·n_s/n₂² = 1.904×1.52/2.657 ≈ 1.090，R = [(1 − 1.090)/(1 + 1.090)]² ≈ 0.0018；理想內層 n₂ = 1.38×√1.52 ≈ 1.70 時 R 趨近 0。V 膜在 550 nm 設計下，500 nm 為 0.51%、600 nm 為 0.41%、450 nm 已達 1.6%。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A quarter-wave MgF₂ single layer on BK7: R = [(n_s − n₁²)/(n_s + n₁²)]² = [(1.52 − 1.904)/(1.52 + 1.904)]² ≈ 0.0126. A two-layer MgF₂/Al₂O₃ (1.38/1.63) design: Y = n₁²·n_s/n₂² = 1.904×1.52/2.657 ≈ 1.090 and R = [(1 − 1.090)/(1 + 1.090)]² ≈ 0.0018; with the ideal inner index n₂ = 1.38×√1.52 ≈ 1.70, R approaches 0. Designed for 550 nm, the V-coat reads 0.51% at 500 nm, 0.41% at 600 nm and already 1.6% at 450 nm. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在導納圖上手繪兩層的軌跡：從 n_s 出發，內層四分之一波沿圓弧走到 n₂²/n_s，外層再走到 n₁²n_s/n₂²，確認終點是否落在 1 附近；再把鍍好的 V 膜用分光光度計掃描，確認最低點波長與設計一致、兩側上升速率符合計算曲線。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Trace the two-layer path on an admittance diagram: start at n_s, let the inner quarter wave move along its arc to n₂²/n_s and the outer layer to n₁²n_s/n₂², and check that the end point lands near 1; then scan the deposited V-coat on a spectrophotometer to confirm that the minimum wavelength matches the design and that the rise on both sides follows the calculated curve.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"單層四分之一波 MgF₂ 於 BK7：R = [(n_s − n₁²)/(n_s + n₁²)]² = [(1.52 − 1.904)/(1.52 + 1.904)]² ≈ 0.0126。雙層 MgF₂/Al₂O₃（1.38/1.63）：Y = n₁²·n_s/n₂² = 1.904×1.52/2.657 ≈ 1.090，R = [(1 − 1.090)/(1 + 1.090)]² ≈ 0.0018；理想內層 n₂ = 1.38×√1.52 ≈ 1.70 時 R 趨近 0。V 膜在 550 nm 設計下，500 nm 為 0.51%、600 nm 為 0.41%、450 nm 已達 1.6%。","textEn":"A quarter-wave MgF₂ single layer on BK7: R = [(n_s − n₁²)/(n_s + n₁²)]² = [(1.52 − 1.904)/(1.52 + 1.904)]² ≈ 0.0126. A two-layer MgF₂/Al₂O₃ (1.38/1.63) design: Y = n₁²·n_s/n₂² = 1.904×1.52/2.657 ≈ 1.090 and R = [(1 − 1.090)/(1 + 1.090)]² ≈ 0.0018; with the ideal inner index n₂ = 1.38×√1.52 ≈ 1.70, R approaches 0. Designed for 550 nm, the V-coat reads 0.51% at 500 nm, 0.41% at 600 nm and already 1.6% at 450 nm.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「導納匹配：單層與 V 形增透膜」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Admittance matching: single-layer and V-coat designs\", which statement holds?","options":["單層四分之一波 MgF₂ 於 BK7：R = [(n_s − n₁²)/(n_s + n₁²)]² = [(1.52 − 1.904)/(1.52 + 1.904)]² ≈ 0.0126。","分光光度計讀到的反射率就是鍍膜面的反射率。","透鏡在腔內轉動，膜厚在整個曲面上自然均勻。"],"optionsEn":["A quarter-wave MgF₂ single layer on BK7: R = [(n_s − n₁²)/(n_s + n₁²)]² = [(1.52 − 1.904)/(1.52 + 1.904)]² ≈ 0.0126.","The reflectance the spectrophotometer reads is the coated surface's reflectance.","Because the lens rotates in the chamber the film is naturally uniform over the whole curved surface."],"answer":0,"explanation":"單層四分之一波 MgF₂ 於 BK7：R = [(n_s − n₁²)/(n_s + n₁²)]² = [(1.52 − 1.904)/(1.52 + 1.904)]² ≈ 0.0126。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A quarter-wave MgF₂ single layer on BK7: R = [(n_s − n₁²)/(n_s + n₁²)]² = [(1.52 − 1.904)/(1.52 + 1.904)]² ≈ 0.0126. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a413-v12-07","title":"導納匹配：單層與 V 形增透膜：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Admittance matching: single-layer and V-coat designs: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「MgF₂ 單層與四分之一波雙層 V 膜」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “MgF₂ single layer and quarter-quarter V-coat” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在導納圖上手繪兩層的軌跡：從 n_s 出發，內層四分之一波沿圓弧走到 n₂²/n_s，外層再走到 n₁²n_s/n₂²，確認終點是否落在 1 附近；再把鍍好的 V 膜用分光光度計掃描，確認最低點波長與設計一致、兩側上升速率符合計算曲線。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Trace the two-layer path on an admittance diagram: start at n_s, let the inner quarter wave move along its arc to n₂²/n_s and the outer layer to n₁²n_s/n₂², and check that the end point lands near 1; then scan the deposited V-coat on a spectrophotometer to confirm that the minimum wavelength matches the design and that the rise on both sides follows the calculated curve. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：把內外層順序顛倒，MgF₂ 貼在玻璃上而 Al₂O₃ 在最外側，導納終點落在 2 以上，反射率反而比裸玻璃高；或用 V 膜處理白光鏡頭，兩端殘餘反射超過 1.5% 而產生偏色。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Reversing the layer order, with MgF₂ against the glass and Al₂O₃ outermost, lands the admittance above 2 and reflects more than bare glass; using a V-coat on a white-light lens leaves residuals above 1.5% at the band ends and causes colour cast.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在導納圖上手繪兩層的軌跡：從 n_s 出發，內層四分之一波沿圓弧走到 n₂²/n_s，外層再走到 n₁²n_s/n₂²，確認終點是否落在 1 附近；再把鍍好的 V 膜用分光光度計掃描，確認最低點波長與設計一致、兩側上升速率符合計算曲線。","textEn":"Trace the two-layer path on an admittance diagram: start at n_s, let the inner quarter wave move along its arc to n₂²/n_s and the outer layer to n₁²n_s/n₂², and check that the end point lands near 1; then scan the deposited V-coat on a spectrophotometer to confirm that the minimum wavelength matches the design and that the rise on both sides follows the calculated curve.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「導納匹配：單層與 V 形增透膜」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Admittance matching: single-layer and V-coat designs\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","在導納圖上手繪兩層的軌跡：從 n_s 出發，內層四分之一波沿圓弧走到 n₂²/n_s，外層再走到 n₁²n_s/n₂²，確認終點是否落在 1 附近。","增透膜越透明越好，規格只需要一個反射率上限。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Trace the two-layer path on an admittance diagram: start at n_s, let the inner quarter wave move along its arc to n₂²/n_s and the outer layer to n₁²n_s/n₂², and check that the end point lands near 1.","An antireflection film only needs to be as transparent as possible, so one reflectance ceiling is specification enough."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在導納圖上手繪兩層的軌跡：從 n_s 出發，內層四分之一波沿圓弧走到 n₂²/n_s，外層再走到 n₁²n_s/n₂²，確認終點是否落在 1 附近；再把鍍好的 V 膜用分光光度計掃描，確認最低點波長與設計一致、兩側上升速率符合計算曲線。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Trace the two-layer path on an admittance diagram: start at n_s, let the inner quarter wave move along its arc to n₂²/n_s and the outer layer to n₁²n_s/n₂², and check that the end point lands near 1; then scan the deposited V-coat on a spectrophotometer to confirm that the minimum wavelength matches the design and that the rise on both sides follows the calculated curve. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a413-v12-08","title":"導納匹配：單層與 V 形增透膜：失效診斷","titleEn":"Admittance matching: single-layer and V-coat designs: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「MgF₂ 單層與四分之一波雙層 V 膜」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “MgF₂ single layer and quarter-quarter V-coat” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"把內外層順序顛倒，MgF₂ 貼在玻璃上而 Al₂O₃ 在最外側，導納終點落在 2 以上，反射率反而比裸玻璃高；或用 V 膜處理白光鏡頭，兩端殘餘反射超過 1.5% 而產生偏色。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Reversing the layer order, with MgF₂ against the glass and Al₂O₃ outermost, lands the admittance above 2 and reflects more than bare glass; using a V-coat on a white-light lens leaves residuals above 1.5% at the band ends and causes colour cast. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：雙層四分之一波設計用內層的高折射率把基板導納先抬高、再由外層 MgF₂ 拉回 1，條件是 n₂/n₁ = √n_s；這種設計在單一波長達到近零反射而兩側迅速上升，光譜呈 V 形，因此稱為 V 膜，適合雷射線寬的應用。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A two-layer quarter-quarter design uses a higher-index inner layer to raise the substrate admittance first and the outer MgF₂ layer to bring it back to 1, with the condition n₂/n₁ = √n_s; it reaches near-zero reflectance at one wavelength and rises quickly on both sides, giving the V-shaped spectrum that names the V-coat and suits laser-line applications.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「增透膜就是鍍一層折射率低於玻璃的材料，越低越好，厚度不重要。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"An antireflection film is just a layer of index lower than glass, the lower the better, with thickness unimportant.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把內外層順序顛倒，MgF₂ 貼在玻璃上而 Al₂O₃ 在最外側，導納終點落在 2 以上，反射率反而比裸玻璃高；或用 V 膜處理白光鏡頭，兩端殘餘反射超過 1.5% 而產生偏色。","textEn":"Reversing the layer order, with MgF₂ against the glass and Al₂O₃ outermost, lands the admittance above 2 and reflects more than bare glass; using a V-coat on a white-light lens leaves residuals above 1.5% at the band ends and causes colour cast.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「導納匹配：單層與 V 形增透膜」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Admittance matching: single-layer and V-coat designs\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","半波層對設計波長沒有作用，所以寬帶膜裡的半波層可以省略。","把內外層順序顛倒，MgF₂ 貼在玻璃上而 Al₂O₃ 在最外側，導納終點落在 2 以上，反射率反而比裸玻璃高。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","A half-wave layer does nothing at the design wavelength, so it can be dropped from a broadband design.","Reversing the layer order, with MgF₂ against the glass and Al₂O₃ outermost, lands the admittance above 2 and reflects more than bare glass."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把內外層順序顛倒，MgF₂ 貼在玻璃上而 Al₂O₃ 在最外側，導納終點落在 2 以上，反射率反而比裸玻璃高；或用 V 膜處理白光鏡頭，兩端殘餘反射超過 1.5% 而產生偏色。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Reversing the layer order, with MgF₂ against the glass and Al₂O₃ outermost, lands the admittance above 2 and reflects more than bare glass; using a V-coat on a white-light lens leaves residuals above 1.5% at the band ends and causes colour cast. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a413-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「寬帶增透設計與層數取捨」與「低折射率膜材、基板溫度與膜應力」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Broadband antireflection design and layer-count trade-offs\" and \"Low-index materials, substrate temperature and film stress\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a413-v12-09","title":"寬帶增透設計與層數取捨：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Broadband antireflection design and layer-count trade-offs: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「四分之一／半波／四分之一寬帶膜」如何決定增透膜設計與沉積的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Quarter-half-quarter broadband design” determines the key performance of “Antireflection coating design and deposition”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"寬帶增透的經典三層結構由基板側起為四分之一波 Al₂O₃、半波 ZrO₂ 與四分之一波 MgF₂：半波層在設計波長是「隱形」的，不改變中心反射率，但在偏離中心的波長上它改變導納軌跡的曲率，把兩側的反射率壓平，使可見光全波段平均降到 0.2% 等級。再往上走是四到八層的 TiO₂/SiO₂ 或 Nb₂O₅/SiO₂ 最佳化設計，可把 400 到 700 nm 的平均反射率壓到 0.2% 以下並延伸到近紅外，代價是總厚度、應力與對厚度誤差的敏感度上升。層數的選擇是光譜寬度、角度容忍度、製程能力與成本之間的平衡。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「四分之一／半波／四分之一寬帶膜」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The classic three-layer broadband structure, from the substrate side, is a quarter-wave Al₂O₃, a half-wave ZrO₂ and a quarter-wave MgF₂: the half-wave layer is absentee at the design wavelength and leaves the central reflectance unchanged, but away from centre it alters the curvature of the admittance path and flattens the reflectance on both sides, bringing the visible-band average to the 0.2% level. Beyond that, four- to eight-layer optimised TiO₂/SiO₂ or Nb₂O₅/SiO₂ designs push the 400 to 700 nm average below 0.2% and extend into the near infrared, at the cost of total thickness, stress and sensitivity to thickness error. Choosing the layer count balances spectral width, angular tolerance, process capability and cost. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Quarter-half-quarter broadband design”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：設計波長 520 nm：MgF₂ 四分之一波 520/(4×1.38) ≈ 94.2 nm、ZrO₂（n = 2.05）半波 520/(2×2.05) ≈ 126.8 nm、Al₂O₃ 四分之一波 520/(4×1.63) ≈ 79.8 nm，總厚 ≈ 301 nm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Design wavelength 520 nm: quarter-wave MgF₂ 520/(4×1.38) ≈ 94.2 nm, half-wave ZrO₂ (n = 2.05) 520/(2×2.05) ≈ 126.8 nm, quarter-wave Al₂O₃ 520/(4×1.63) ≈ 79.8 nm, total ≈ 301 nm.","failure":"常見誤解：「半波層對設計波長沒有作用，所以寬帶膜裡的半波層可以省略。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A half-wave layer does nothing at the design wavelength, so it can be dropped from a broadband design.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「四分之一／半波／四分之一寬帶膜」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Quarter-half-quarter broadband design”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-09-k1","title":"寬帶增透設計與層數取捨","titleEn":"Broadband antireflection design and layer-count trade-offs","text":"寬帶增透的經典三層結構由基板側起為四分之一波 Al₂O₃、半波 ZrO₂ 與四分之一波 MgF₂：半波層在設計波長是「隱形」的，不改變中心反射率，但在偏離中心的波長上它改變導納軌跡的曲率，把兩側的反射率壓平，使可見光全波段平均降到 0.2% 等級。再往上走是四到八層的 TiO₂/SiO₂ 或 Nb₂O₅/SiO₂ 最佳化設計，可把 400 到 700 nm 的平均反射率壓到 0.2% 以下並延伸到近紅外，代價是總厚度、應力與對厚度誤差的敏感度上升。","textEn":"The classic three-layer broadband structure, from the substrate side, is a quarter-wave Al₂O₃, a half-wave ZrO₂ and a quarter-wave MgF₂: the half-wave layer is absentee at the design wavelength and leaves the central reflectance unchanged, but away from centre it alters the curvature of the admittance path and flattens the reflectance on both sides, bringing the visible-band average to the 0.2% level. Beyond that, four- to eight-layer optimised TiO₂/SiO₂ or Nb₂O₅/SiO₂ designs push the 400 to 700 nm average below 0.2% and extend into the near infrared, at the cost of total thickness, stress and sensitivity to thickness error.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：半波層對設計波長沒有作用，所以寬帶膜裡的半波層可以省略。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A half-wave layer does nothing at the design wavelength, so it can be dropped from a broadband design. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「寬帶增透設計與層數取捨」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Broadband antireflection design and layer-count trade-offs\" is correct?","options":["寬帶增透的經典三層結構由基板側起為四分之一波 Al₂O₃、半波 ZrO₂ 與四分之一波 MgF₂：半波層在設計波長是「隱形」的，不改變中心反射率，但在偏離中心的波長上它改變導納軌跡的曲率，把兩側的反射率壓平，使可見光全波段平均降到 0.2% 等級。","半波層對設計波長沒有作用，所以寬帶膜裡的半波層可以省略。","同一種膜材無論怎麼鍍，折射率與耐久性都一樣。"],"optionsEn":["The classic three-layer broadband structure, from the substrate side, is a quarter-wave Al₂O₃, a half-wave ZrO₂ and a quarter-wave MgF₂: the half-wave layer is absentee at the design wavelength and leaves the central reflectance unchanged, but away from centre it alters the curvature of the admittance path and flattens the reflectance on both sides, bringing the visible-band average to the 0.2% level.","A half-wave layer does nothing at the design wavelength, so it can be dropped from a broadband design.","A given material has the same index and durability however it is deposited."],"answer":0,"explanation":"寬帶增透的經典三層結構由基板側起為四分之一波 Al₂O₃、半波 ZrO₂ 與四分之一波 MgF₂：半波層在設計波長是「隱形」的，不改變中心反射率，但在偏離中心的波長上它改變導納軌跡的曲率，把兩側的反射率壓平，使可見光全波段平均降到 0.2% 等級。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The classic three-layer broadband structure, from the substrate side, is a quarter-wave Al₂O₃, a half-wave ZrO₂ and a quarter-wave MgF₂: the half-wave layer is absentee at the design wavelength and leaves the central reflectance unchanged, but away from centre it alters the curvature of the admittance path and flattens the reflectance on both sides, bringing the visible-band average to the 0.2% level. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a413-v12-10","title":"寬帶增透設計與層數取捨：定量估算","titleEn":"Broadband antireflection design and layer-count trade-offs: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「四分之一／半波／四分之一寬帶膜」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Quarter-half-quarter broadband design” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：設計波長 520 nm：MgF₂ 四分之一波 520/(4×1.38) ≈ 94.2 nm、ZrO₂（n = 2.05）半波 520/(2×2.05) ≈ 126.8 nm、Al₂O₃ 四分之一波 520/(4×1.63) ≈ 79.8 nm，總厚 ≈ 301 nm。矩陣計算得 R(450) ≈ 0.03%、R(500) ≈ 0.17%、R(600) ≈ 0.04%、R(700) ≈ 0.54%，400 到 700 nm 平均 ≈ 0.20%；同樣基板的單層 MgF₂ 平均為 1.48%。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Design wavelength 520 nm: quarter-wave MgF₂ 520/(4×1.38) ≈ 94.2 nm, half-wave ZrO₂ (n = 2.05) 520/(2×2.05) ≈ 126.8 nm, quarter-wave Al₂O₃ 520/(4×1.63) ≈ 79.8 nm, total ≈ 301 nm. The matrix calculation gives R(450) ≈ 0.03%, R(500) ≈ 0.17%, R(600) ≈ 0.04%, R(700) ≈ 0.54% and a 400 to 700 nm average ≈ 0.20%; a single MgF₂ layer on the same substrate averages 1.48%. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用薄膜軟體把三層設計與一個六層最佳化設計放在同一張圖上比較平均反射率、最大反射率與總厚度；把三層設計的每層厚度各隨機擾動 ±3% 做一百次蒙地卡羅，統計平均反射率的分佈，判斷製程能力是否足以支撐該設計。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Overlay the three-layer design and a six-layer optimised design in thin-film software and compare average reflectance, maximum reflectance and total thickness; perturb each layer of the three-layer design randomly by ±3% in a hundred Monte-Carlo trials and examine the distribution of average reflectance to judge whether the process capability supports the design.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"設計波長 520 nm：MgF₂ 四分之一波 520/(4×1.38) ≈ 94.2 nm、ZrO₂（n = 2.05）半波 520/(2×2.05) ≈ 126.8 nm、Al₂O₃ 四分之一波 520/(4×1.63) ≈ 79.8 nm，總厚 ≈ 301 nm。矩陣計算得 R(450) ≈ 0.03%、R(500) ≈ 0.17%、R(600) ≈ 0.04%、R(700) ≈ 0.54%，400 到 700 nm 平均 ≈ 0.20%；同樣基板的單層 MgF₂ 平均為 1.48%。","textEn":"Design wavelength 520 nm: quarter-wave MgF₂ 520/(4×1.38) ≈ 94.2 nm, half-wave ZrO₂ (n = 2.05) 520/(2×2.05) ≈ 126.8 nm, quarter-wave Al₂O₃ 520/(4×1.63) ≈ 79.8 nm, total ≈ 301 nm. The matrix calculation gives R(450) ≈ 0.03%, R(500) ≈ 0.17%, R(600) ≈ 0.04%, R(700) ≈ 0.54% and a 400 to 700 nm average ≈ 0.20%; a single MgF₂ layer on the same substrate averages 1.48%.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「寬帶增透設計與層數取捨」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Broadband antireflection design and layer-count trade-offs\", which statement holds?","options":["增透膜對入射角不敏感，正向量測合格就能用在任何角度。","設計波長 520 nm：MgF₂ 四分之一波 520/(4×1.38) ≈ 94.2 nm、ZrO₂（n = 2.05）半波 520/(2×2.05) ≈ 126.8 nm、Al₂O₃ 四分之一波 520/(4×1.63) ≈ 79.8 nm，總厚 ≈ 301 nm。","增透膜越透明越好，規格只需要一個反射率上限。"],"optionsEn":["Antireflection films are insensitive to incidence angle, so passing at normal incidence qualifies any angle.","Design wavelength 520 nm: quarter-wave MgF₂ 520/(4×1.38) ≈ 94.2 nm, half-wave ZrO₂ (n = 2.05) 520/(2×2.05) ≈ 126.8 nm, quarter-wave Al₂O₃ 520/(4×1.63) ≈ 79.8 nm, total ≈ 301 nm.","An antireflection film only needs to be as transparent as possible, so one reflectance ceiling is specification enough."],"answer":1,"explanation":"設計波長 520 nm：MgF₂ 四分之一波 520/(4×1.38) ≈ 94.2 nm、ZrO₂（n = 2.05）半波 520/(2×2.05) ≈ 126.8 nm、Al₂O₃ 四分之一波 520/(4×1.63) ≈ 79.8 nm，總厚 ≈ 301 nm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Design wavelength 520 nm: quarter-wave MgF₂ 520/(4×1.38) ≈ 94.2 nm, half-wave ZrO₂ (n = 2.05) 520/(2×2.05) ≈ 126.8 nm, quarter-wave Al₂O₃ 520/(4×1.63) ≈ 79.8 nm, total ≈ 301 nm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a413-v12-11","title":"寬帶增透設計與層數取捨：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Broadband antireflection design and layer-count trade-offs: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「四分之一／半波／四分之一寬帶膜」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Quarter-half-quarter broadband design” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用薄膜軟體把三層設計與一個六層最佳化設計放在同一張圖上比較平均反射率、最大反射率與總厚度；把三層設計的每層厚度各隨機擾動 ±3% 做一百次蒙地卡羅，統計平均反射率的分佈，判斷製程能力是否足以支撐該設計。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Overlay the three-layer design and a six-layer optimised design in thin-film software and compare average reflectance, maximum reflectance and total thickness; perturb each layer of the three-layer design randomly by ±3% in a hundred Monte-Carlo trials and examine the distribution of average reflectance to judge whether the process capability supports the design. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：為了追求 0.1% 的平均反射率採用十二層設計，但蒸鍍腔的厚度控制只有 ±3%，量產批次的平均反射率散佈到 0.1% 至 0.6%，良率不到一半，反而不如製程穩定的三層設計。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Chasing a 0.1% average with a twelve-layer design in an evaporation chamber whose thickness control is only ±3% scatters production batches between 0.1% and 0.6% with under fifty percent yield, worse than a process-robust three-layer design.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用薄膜軟體把三層設計與一個六層最佳化設計放在同一張圖上比較平均反射率、最大反射率與總厚度；把三層設計的每層厚度各隨機擾動 ±3% 做一百次蒙地卡羅，統計平均反射率的分佈，判斷製程能力是否足以支撐該設計。","textEn":"Overlay the three-layer design and a six-layer optimised design in thin-film software and compare average reflectance, maximum reflectance and total thickness; perturb each layer of the three-layer design randomly by ±3% in a hundred Monte-Carlo trials and examine the distribution of average reflectance to judge whether the process capability supports the design.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「寬帶增透設計與層數取捨」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Broadband antireflection design and layer-count trade-offs\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","一片鏡片只損失 4%，所以整支鏡頭不鍍膜也只差幾個百分點。","用薄膜軟體把三層設計與一個六層最佳化設計放在同一張圖上比較平均反射率、最大反射率與總厚度。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","One element loses only 4%, so an uncoated lens is only a few percent worse overall.","Overlay the three-layer design and a six-layer optimised design in thin-film software and compare average reflectance, maximum reflectance and total thickness."],"answer":2,"explanation":"用薄膜軟體把三層設計與一個六層最佳化設計放在同一張圖上比較平均反射率、最大反射率與總厚度；把三層設計的每層厚度各隨機擾動 ±3% 做一百次蒙地卡羅，統計平均反射率的分佈，判斷製程能力是否足以支撐該設計。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Overlay the three-layer design and a six-layer optimised design in thin-film software and compare average reflectance, maximum reflectance and total thickness; perturb each layer of the three-layer design randomly by ±3% in a hundred Monte-Carlo trials and examine the distribution of average reflectance to judge whether the process capability supports the design. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a413-v12-12","title":"寬帶增透設計與層數取捨：失效診斷","titleEn":"Broadband antireflection design and layer-count trade-offs: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「四分之一／半波／四分之一寬帶膜」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Quarter-half-quarter broadband design” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"為了追求 0.1% 的平均反射率採用十二層設計，但蒸鍍腔的厚度控制只有 ±3%，量產批次的平均反射率散佈到 0.1% 至 0.6%，良率不到一半，反而不如製程穩定的三層設計。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Chasing a 0.1% average with a twelve-layer design in an evaporation chamber whose thickness control is only ±3% scatters production batches between 0.1% and 0.6% with under fifty percent yield, worse than a process-robust three-layer design. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：層數的選擇是光譜寬度、角度容忍度、製程能力與成本之間的平衡。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Choosing the layer count balances spectral width, angular tolerance, process capability and cost.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「半波層對設計波長沒有作用，所以寬帶膜裡的半波層可以省略。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A half-wave layer does nothing at the design wavelength, so it can be dropped from a broadband design.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"為了追求 0.1% 的平均反射率採用十二層設計，但蒸鍍腔的厚度控制只有 ±3%，量產批次的平均反射率散佈到 0.1% 至 0.6%，良率不到一半，反而不如製程穩定的三層設計。","textEn":"Chasing a 0.1% average with a twelve-layer design in an evaporation chamber whose thickness control is only ±3% scatters production batches between 0.1% and 0.6% with under fifty percent yield, worse than a process-robust three-layer design.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「寬帶增透設計與層數取捨」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Broadband antireflection design and layer-count trade-offs\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["為了追求 0.1% 的平均反射率採用十二層設計，但蒸鍍腔的厚度控制只有 ±3%，量產批次的平均反射率散佈到 0.1% 至 0.6%，良率不到一半，反而不如製程穩定的三層設計。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","同一種膜材無論怎麼鍍，折射率與耐久性都一樣。"],"optionsEn":["Chasing a 0.1% average with a twelve-layer design in an evaporation chamber whose thickness control is only ±3% scatters production batches between 0.1% and 0.6% with under fifty percent yield, worse than a process-robust three-layer design.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A given material has the same index and durability however it is deposited."],"answer":0,"explanation":"為了追求 0.1% 的平均反射率採用十二層設計，但蒸鍍腔的厚度控制只有 ±3%，量產批次的平均反射率散佈到 0.1% 至 0.6%，良率不到一半，反而不如製程穩定的三層設計。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Chasing a 0.1% average with a twelve-layer design in an evaporation chamber whose thickness control is only ±3% scatters production batches between 0.1% and 0.6% with under fifty percent yield, worse than a process-robust three-layer design. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a413-v12-13","title":"低折射率膜材、基板溫度與膜應力：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Low-index materials, substrate temperature and film stress: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「熱基板蒸鍍與低折射率膜材」如何決定增透膜設計與沉積的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Hot-substrate evaporation and low-index materials” determines the key performance of “Antireflection coating design and deposition”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"增透膜的最外層必須是低折射率材料，可見光區幾乎只有 MgF₂ 與 SiO₂ 可選。MgF₂ 以熱蒸鍍或電子束蒸鍍沉積，基板必須加熱到 250 °C 以上才能得到緻密、附著良好且耐擦拭的膜，冷基板上的 MgF₂ 疏鬆、吸濕且一擦就花。玻璃透鏡可以承受加熱，但塑膠透鏡只能在 80 °C 以下處理，必須改用離子輔助蒸鍍或濺鍍 SiO₂ 並加上附著層。加熱沉積後冷卻時，膜與基板的熱膨脹差異在膜內留下張應力，厚膜系會因此龜裂，這是寬帶多層增透膜總厚度受限的原因之一。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「熱基板蒸鍍與低折射率膜材」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The outermost antireflection layer must be a low-index material, and in the visible there are essentially only MgF₂ and SiO₂. MgF₂ is deposited by thermal or electron-beam evaporation with the substrate heated above 250 °C to obtain a dense, well-adhered, wipe-resistant film; on a cold substrate MgF₂ is porous, hygroscopic and scratches at the first wipe. Glass lenses tolerate heating, but polymer lenses must stay below 80 °C, forcing ion-assisted evaporation or sputtered SiO₂ with an adhesion layer. On cooling after hot deposition the thermal-expansion mismatch between film and substrate leaves tensile stress in the film, which cracks thick stacks and is one reason the total thickness of broadband multilayers is limited. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Hot-substrate evaporation and low-index materials”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：熱失配應力 σ_f ≈ [E_f/(1 − ν_f)]·(α_f − α_s)·ΔT。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Thermal-mismatch stress σ_f ≈ [E_f/(1 − ν_f)]·(α_f − α_s)·ΔT.","failure":"常見誤解：「同一種膜材無論怎麼鍍，折射率與耐久性都一樣。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A given material has the same index and durability however it is deposited.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「熱基板蒸鍍與低折射率膜材」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Hot-substrate evaporation and low-index materials”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-13-k1","title":"低折射率膜材、基板溫度與膜應力","titleEn":"Low-index materials, substrate temperature and film stress","text":"增透膜的最外層必須是低折射率材料，可見光區幾乎只有 MgF₂ 與 SiO₂ 可選。MgF₂ 以熱蒸鍍或電子束蒸鍍沉積，基板必須加熱到 250 °C 以上才能得到緻密、附著良好且耐擦拭的膜，冷基板上的 MgF₂ 疏鬆、吸濕且一擦就花。","textEn":"The outermost antireflection layer must be a low-index material, and in the visible there are essentially only MgF₂ and SiO₂. MgF₂ is deposited by thermal or electron-beam evaporation with the substrate heated above 250 °C to obtain a dense, well-adhered, wipe-resistant film; on a cold substrate MgF₂ is porous, hygroscopic and scratches at the first wipe.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：同一種膜材無論怎麼鍍，折射率與耐久性都一樣。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A given material has the same index and durability however it is deposited. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「低折射率膜材、基板溫度與膜應力」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Low-index materials, substrate temperature and film stress\" is correct?","options":["同一種膜材無論怎麼鍍，折射率與耐久性都一樣。","增透膜的最外層必須是低折射率材料，可見光區幾乎只有 MgF₂ 與 SiO₂ 可選。","分光光度計讀到的反射率就是鍍膜面的反射率。"],"optionsEn":["A given material has the same index and durability however it is deposited.","The outermost antireflection layer must be a low-index material, and in the visible there are essentially only MgF₂ and SiO₂.","The reflectance the spectrophotometer reads is the coated surface's reflectance."],"answer":1,"explanation":"增透膜的最外層必須是低折射率材料，可見光區幾乎只有 MgF₂ 與 SiO₂ 可選。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The outermost antireflection layer must be a low-index material, and in the visible there are essentially only MgF₂ and SiO₂. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a413-v12-14","title":"低折射率膜材、基板溫度與膜應力：定量估算","titleEn":"Low-index materials, substrate temperature and film stress: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「熱基板蒸鍍與低折射率膜材」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Hot-substrate evaporation and low-index materials” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：熱失配應力 σ_f ≈ [E_f/(1 − ν_f)]·(α_f − α_s)·ΔT。取 MgF₂ 膜 E_f = 100 GPa、ν_f = 0.3（教學假設）、平均 α_f = 11×10⁻⁶/K，BK7 α_s = 7.1×10⁻⁶/K，由 275 °C 冷卻到 25 °C 的 ΔT = 250 K：σ_f ≈ 1.43×10¹¹ × 3.9×10⁻⁶ × 250 ≈ 1.4×10⁸ Pa ≈ 140 MPa 張應力；對 94 nm 的單層可承受，對 1 µm 以上的多層堆則接近龜裂門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Thermal-mismatch stress σ_f ≈ [E_f/(1 − ν_f)]·(α_f − α_s)·ΔT. Taking a MgF₂ film with E_f = 100 GPa and ν_f = 0.3 (teaching assumptions), mean α_f = 11×10⁻⁶/K, BK7 α_s = 7.1×10⁻⁶/K and ΔT = 250 K for cooling from 275 °C to 25 °C: σ_f ≈ 1.43×10¹¹ × 3.9×10⁻⁶ × 250 ≈ 1.4×10⁸ Pa ≈ 140 MPa tensile, tolerable for a 94 nm single layer but close to the cracking threshold for stacks above 1 µm. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以不同基板溫度（100、200、300 °C）各鍍一片 MgF₂ 試片，用橢偏儀量折射率並以濕度循環觀察光譜位移，確認高溫片的折射率接近 1.38 且位移最小；以薄片基板的曲率變化量膜應力，並做膠帶附著與橡皮擦磨耗測試比較三者。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Deposit MgF₂ witness samples at substrate temperatures of 100, 200 and 300 °C, measure index by ellipsometry and spectral shift under humidity cycling to confirm the hot sample sits near 1.38 with minimal shift; measure film stress from the curvature change of thin substrates and compare the three with tape-adhesion and eraser-abrasion tests.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"熱失配應力 σ_f ≈ [E_f/(1 − ν_f)]·(α_f − α_s)·ΔT。取 MgF₂ 膜 E_f = 100 GPa、ν_f = 0.3（教學假設）、平均 α_f = 11×10⁻⁶/K，BK7 α_s = 7.1×10⁻⁶/K，由 275 °C 冷卻到 25 °C 的 ΔT = 250 K：σ_f ≈ 1.43×10¹¹ × 3.9×10⁻⁶ × 250 ≈ 1.4×10⁸ Pa ≈ 140 MPa 張應力；對 94 nm 的單層可承受，對 1 µm 以上的多層堆則接近龜裂門檻。","textEn":"Thermal-mismatch stress σ_f ≈ [E_f/(1 − ν_f)]·(α_f − α_s)·ΔT. Taking a MgF₂ film with E_f = 100 GPa and ν_f = 0.3 (teaching assumptions), mean α_f = 11×10⁻⁶/K, BK7 α_s = 7.1×10⁻⁶/K and ΔT = 250 K for cooling from 275 °C to 25 °C: σ_f ≈ 1.43×10¹¹ × 3.9×10⁻⁶ × 250 ≈ 1.4×10⁸ Pa ≈ 140 MPa tensile, tolerable for a 94 nm single layer but close to the cracking threshold for stacks above 1 µm.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「低折射率膜材、基板溫度與膜應力」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Low-index materials, substrate temperature and film stress\", which statement holds?","options":["透鏡在腔內轉動，膜厚在整個曲面上自然均勻。","一片鏡片只損失 4%，所以整支鏡頭不鍍膜也只差幾個百分點。","熱失配應力 σ_f ≈ [E_f/(1 − ν_f)]·(α_f − α_s)·ΔT。"],"optionsEn":["Because the lens rotates in the chamber the film is naturally uniform over the whole curved surface.","One element loses only 4%, so an uncoated lens is only a few percent worse overall.","Thermal-mismatch stress σ_f ≈ [E_f/(1 − ν_f)]·(α_f − α_s)·ΔT."],"answer":2,"explanation":"熱失配應力 σ_f ≈ [E_f/(1 − ν_f)]·(α_f − α_s)·ΔT。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Thermal-mismatch stress σ_f ≈ [E_f/(1 − ν_f)]·(α_f − α_s)·ΔT. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a413-v12-15","title":"低折射率膜材、基板溫度與膜應力：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Low-index materials, substrate temperature and film stress: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「熱基板蒸鍍與低折射率膜材」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Hot-substrate evaporation and low-index materials” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以不同基板溫度（100、200、300 °C）各鍍一片 MgF₂ 試片，用橢偏儀量折射率並以濕度循環觀察光譜位移，確認高溫片的折射率接近 1.38 且位移最小；以薄片基板的曲率變化量膜應力，並做膠帶附著與橡皮擦磨耗測試比較三者。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Deposit MgF₂ witness samples at substrate temperatures of 100, 200 and 300 °C, measure index by ellipsometry and spectral shift under humidity cycling to confirm the hot sample sits near 1.38 with minimal shift; measure film stress from the curvature change of thin substrates and compare the three with tape-adhesion and eraser-abrasion tests. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：為了趕工在未達溫的基板上鍍 MgF₂，膜層疏鬆，出廠光譜合格但客戶擦拭後出現霧狀刮痕並在潮濕環境下反射率回升；塑膠鏡片誤用熱製程而翹曲變形。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Depositing MgF₂ on substrates that have not reached temperature to save time gives porous films that pass at shipment but haze and scratch when the customer wipes them and lose antireflection in humid air; a polymer lens run through the hot process warps.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以不同基板溫度（100、200、300 °C）各鍍一片 MgF₂ 試片，用橢偏儀量折射率並以濕度循環觀察光譜位移，確認高溫片的折射率接近 1.38 且位移最小；以薄片基板的曲率變化量膜應力，並做膠帶附著與橡皮擦磨耗測試比較三者。","textEn":"Deposit MgF₂ witness samples at substrate temperatures of 100, 200 and 300 °C, measure index by ellipsometry and spectral shift under humidity cycling to confirm the hot sample sits near 1.38 with minimal shift; measure film stress from the curvature change of thin substrates and compare the three with tape-adhesion and eraser-abrasion tests.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「低折射率膜材、基板溫度與膜應力」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Low-index materials, substrate temperature and film stress\"?","options":["以不同基板溫度（100、200、300 °C）各鍍一片 MgF₂ 試片，用橢偏儀量折射率並以濕度循環觀察光譜位移，確認高溫片的折射率接近 1.38 且位移最小。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","增透膜就是鍍一層折射率低於玻璃的材料，越低越好，厚度不重要。"],"optionsEn":["Deposit MgF₂ witness samples at substrate temperatures of 100, 200 and 300 °C, measure index by ellipsometry and spectral shift under humidity cycling to confirm the hot sample sits near 1.38 with minimal shift.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","An antireflection film is just a layer of index lower than glass, the lower the better, with thickness unimportant."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以不同基板溫度（100、200、300 °C）各鍍一片 MgF₂ 試片，用橢偏儀量折射率並以濕度循環觀察光譜位移，確認高溫片的折射率接近 1.38 且位移最小；以薄片基板的曲率變化量膜應力，並做膠帶附著與橡皮擦磨耗測試比較三者。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Deposit MgF₂ witness samples at substrate temperatures of 100, 200 and 300 °C, measure index by ellipsometry and spectral shift under humidity cycling to confirm the hot sample sits near 1.38 with minimal shift; measure film stress from the curvature change of thin substrates and compare the three with tape-adhesion and eraser-abrasion tests. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a413-v12-16","title":"低折射率膜材、基板溫度與膜應力：失效診斷","titleEn":"Low-index materials, substrate temperature and film stress: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「熱基板蒸鍍與低折射率膜材」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Hot-substrate evaporation and low-index materials” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"為了趕工在未達溫的基板上鍍 MgF₂，膜層疏鬆，出廠光譜合格但客戶擦拭後出現霧狀刮痕並在潮濕環境下反射率回升；塑膠鏡片誤用熱製程而翹曲變形。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Depositing MgF₂ on substrates that have not reached temperature to save time gives porous films that pass at shipment but haze and scratch when the customer wipes them and lose antireflection in humid air; a polymer lens run through the hot process warps. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：加熱沉積後冷卻時，膜與基板的熱膨脹差異在膜內留下張應力，厚膜系會因此龜裂，這是寬帶多層增透膜總厚度受限的原因之一。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: On cooling after hot deposition the thermal-expansion mismatch between film and substrate leaves tensile stress in the film, which cracks thick stacks and is one reason the total thickness of broadband multilayers is limited.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「同一種膜材無論怎麼鍍，折射率與耐久性都一樣。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A given material has the same index and durability however it is deposited.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"為了趕工在未達溫的基板上鍍 MgF₂，膜層疏鬆，出廠光譜合格但客戶擦拭後出現霧狀刮痕並在潮濕環境下反射率回升；塑膠鏡片誤用熱製程而翹曲變形。","textEn":"Depositing MgF₂ on substrates that have not reached temperature to save time gives porous films that pass at shipment but haze and scratch when the customer wipes them and lose antireflection in humid air; a polymer lens run through the hot process warps.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「低折射率膜材、基板溫度與膜應力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Low-index materials, substrate temperature and film stress\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","為了趕工在未達溫的基板上鍍 MgF₂，膜層疏鬆，出廠光譜合格但客戶擦拭後出現霧狀刮痕並在潮濕環境下反射率回升；塑膠鏡片誤用熱製程而翹曲變形。","分光光度計讀到的反射率就是鍍膜面的反射率。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Depositing MgF₂ on substrates that have not reached temperature to save time gives porous films that pass at shipment but haze and scratch when the customer wipes them and lose antireflection in humid air.","The reflectance the spectrophotometer reads is the coated surface's reflectance."],"answer":1,"explanation":"為了趕工在未達溫的基板上鍍 MgF₂，膜層疏鬆，出廠光譜合格但客戶擦拭後出現霧狀刮痕並在潮濕環境下反射率回升；塑膠鏡片誤用熱製程而翹曲變形。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Depositing MgF₂ on substrates that have not reached temperature to save time gives porous films that pass at shipment but haze and scratch when the customer wipes them and lose antireflection in humid air; a polymer lens run through the hot process warps. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a413-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「低反射率量測與背面陷阱」與「入射角、偏振與厚度公差」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Low-reflectance metrology and the back-surface trap\" and \"Incidence angle, polarization and thickness tolerance\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a413-v12-17","title":"低反射率量測與背面陷阱：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Low-reflectance metrology and the back-surface trap: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「V-W 反射率附件與背面處理」如何決定增透膜設計與沉積的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “V-W reflectance accessory and back-surface handling” determines the key performance of “Antireflection coating design and deposition”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"量 0.2% 的反射率比量 99% 的反射率困難得多，因為任何雜散光與基板背面的反射都會淹沒訊號。平行平板試片若只有正面鍍膜，背面的 4.3% 反射會穿過正面進入偵測器，量到的總反射率幾乎全是背面貢獻；所以量測前必須把背面磨粗並塗黑，或使用楔形試片把背面反射偏離光路，或以穿透率反推。絕對反射率需要 V-W 型附件，用同一面鏡子在兩種幾何下的比值消去鏡面反射率；光度刻度則以 NIST 可追溯的反射率標準校正。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「V-W 反射率附件與背面處理」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Measuring 0.2% reflectance is far harder than measuring 99%, because any stray light and the substrate's back-surface reflection swamp the signal. A plane-parallel witness coated only on the front lets the 4.3% back reflection pass through the front into the detector, so the measured total is almost entirely the back surface; the back must therefore be ground and blackened, a wedged witness used to steer the back reflection out of the path, or the front reflectance inferred from transmission. Absolute reflectance needs a V-W accessory, where the ratio of two geometries with the same mirror cancels the mirror's reflectance, and the photometric scale is calibrated with NIST-traceable reflectance standards. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “V-W reflectance accessory and back-surface handling”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：正面 V 膜 R_f = 0.18%、背面裸玻璃 R_b = 4.26% 的平板：量到的反射率 ≈ R_f + (1 − R_f)²·R_b ≈ 0.0018 + 0.9964×0.0426 ≈ 4.43%，正面訊號只佔 4%。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A plate with a V-coat front R_f = 0.18% and a bare back R_b = 4.26% measures ≈ R_f + (1 − R_f)²·R_b ≈ 0.0018 + 0.9964×0.0426 ≈ 4.43%, with the front contributing only 4% of the signal.","failure":"常見誤解：「分光光度計讀到的反射率就是鍍膜面的反射率。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The reflectance the spectrophotometer reads is the coated surface's reflectance.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「V-W 反射率附件與背面處理」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “V-W reflectance accessory and back-surface handling”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-17-k1","title":"低反射率量測與背面陷阱","titleEn":"Low-reflectance metrology and the back-surface trap","text":"量 0.2% 的反射率比量 99% 的反射率困難得多，因為任何雜散光與基板背面的反射都會淹沒訊號。平行平板試片若只有正面鍍膜，背面的 4.3% 反射會穿過正面進入偵測器，量到的總反射率幾乎全是背面貢獻；所以量測前必須把背面磨粗並塗黑，或使用楔形試片把背面反射偏離光路，或以穿透率反推。","textEn":"Measuring 0.2% reflectance is far harder than measuring 99%, because any stray light and the substrate's back-surface reflection swamp the signal. A plane-parallel witness coated only on the front lets the 4.3% back reflection pass through the front into the detector, so the measured total is almost entirely the back surface; the back must therefore be ground and blackened, a wedged witness used to steer the back reflection out of the path, or the front reflectance inferred from transmission.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：分光光度計讀到的反射率就是鍍膜面的反射率。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The reflectance the spectrophotometer reads is the coated surface's reflectance. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「低反射率量測與背面陷阱」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Low-reflectance metrology and the back-surface trap\" is correct?","options":["分光光度計讀到的反射率就是鍍膜面的反射率。","增透膜對入射角不敏感，正向量測合格就能用在任何角度。","量 0.2% 的反射率比量 99% 的反射率困難得多，因為任何雜散光與基板背面的反射都會淹沒訊號。"],"optionsEn":["The reflectance the spectrophotometer reads is the coated surface's reflectance.","Antireflection films are insensitive to incidence angle, so passing at normal incidence qualifies any angle.","Measuring 0.2% reflectance is far harder than measuring 99%, because any stray light and the substrate's back-surface reflection swamp the signal."],"answer":2,"explanation":"量 0.2% 的反射率比量 99% 的反射率困難得多，因為任何雜散光與基板背面的反射都會淹沒訊號。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Measuring 0.2% reflectance is far harder than measuring 99%, because any stray light and the substrate's back-surface reflection swamp the signal. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a413-v12-18","title":"低反射率量測與背面陷阱：定量估算","titleEn":"Low-reflectance metrology and the back-surface trap: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「V-W 反射率附件與背面處理」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “V-W reflectance accessory and back-surface handling” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：正面 V 膜 R_f = 0.18%、背面裸玻璃 R_b = 4.26% 的平板：量到的反射率 ≈ R_f + (1 − R_f)²·R_b ≈ 0.0018 + 0.9964×0.0426 ≈ 4.43%，正面訊號只佔 4%。改量穿透率 T ≈ (1 − R_f)(1 − R_b) ≈ 0.9557，由 T 反推 R_f = 1 − T/(1 − R_b)，當 T 的不確定度為 0.1% 時 R_f 的不確定度約 0.1%，仍不足以驗證 0.18%，所以必須塗黑背面直接量。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A plate with a V-coat front R_f = 0.18% and a bare back R_b = 4.26% measures ≈ R_f + (1 − R_f)²·R_b ≈ 0.0018 + 0.9964×0.0426 ≈ 4.43%, with the front contributing only 4% of the signal. Measuring transmission instead, T ≈ (1 − R_f)(1 − R_b) ≈ 0.9557 and R_f = 1 − T/(1 − R_b); a 0.1% uncertainty in T gives about 0.1% uncertainty in R_f, still too coarse to verify 0.18%, so the back must be blackened and the front measured directly. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：同一片試片分別以未處理背面、塗黑背面與楔形試片三種方式量測，確認塗黑後的讀值降到與設計相符的 0.2% 等級且重複性優於 0.03%；以已知反射率的標準片確認光度刻度，並記錄量測光斑大小與入射角。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the same witness three ways, with untreated back, blackened back and as a wedged piece, confirming that the blackened reading drops to the design-level 0.2% with repeatability better than 0.03%; verify the photometric scale with a standard of known reflectance and record the spot size and incidence angle.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"正面 V 膜 R_f = 0.18%、背面裸玻璃 R_b = 4.26% 的平板：量到的反射率 ≈ R_f + (1 − R_f)²·R_b ≈ 0.0018 + 0.9964×0.0426 ≈ 4.43%，正面訊號只佔 4%。改量穿透率 T ≈ (1 − R_f)(1 − R_b) ≈ 0.9557，由 T 反推 R_f = 1 − T/(1 − R_b)，當 T 的不確定度為 0.1% 時 R_f 的不確定度約 0.1%，仍不足以驗證 0.18%，所以必須塗黑背面直接量。","textEn":"A plate with a V-coat front R_f = 0.18% and a bare back R_b = 4.26% measures ≈ R_f + (1 − R_f)²·R_b ≈ 0.0018 + 0.9964×0.0426 ≈ 4.43%, with the front contributing only 4% of the signal. Measuring transmission instead, T ≈ (1 − R_f)(1 − R_b) ≈ 0.9557 and R_f = 1 − T/(1 − R_b); a 0.1% uncertainty in T gives about 0.1% uncertainty in R_f, still too coarse to verify 0.18%, so the back must be blackened and the front measured directly.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「低反射率量測與背面陷阱」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Low-reflectance metrology and the back-surface trap\", which statement holds?","options":["正面 V 膜 R_f = 0.18%、背面裸玻璃 R_b = 4.26% 的平板：量到的反射率 ≈ R_f + (1 − R_f)²·R_b ≈ 0.0018 + 0.9964×0.0426 ≈ 4.43%，正面訊號只佔 4%。","增透膜越透明越好，規格只需要一個反射率上限。","增透膜就是鍍一層折射率低於玻璃的材料，越低越好，厚度不重要。"],"optionsEn":["A plate with a V-coat front R_f = 0.18% and a bare back R_b = 4.26% measures ≈ R_f + (1 − R_f)²·R_b ≈ 0.0018 + 0.9964×0.0426 ≈ 4.43%, with the front contributing only 4% of the signal.","An antireflection film only needs to be as transparent as possible, so one reflectance ceiling is specification enough.","An antireflection film is just a layer of index lower than glass, the lower the better, with thickness unimportant."],"answer":0,"explanation":"正面 V 膜 R_f = 0.18%、背面裸玻璃 R_b = 4.26% 的平板：量到的反射率 ≈ R_f + (1 − R_f)²·R_b ≈ 0.0018 + 0.9964×0.0426 ≈ 4.43%，正面訊號只佔 4%。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A plate with a V-coat front R_f = 0.18% and a bare back R_b = 4.26% measures ≈ R_f + (1 − R_f)²·R_b ≈ 0.0018 + 0.9964×0.0426 ≈ 4.43%, with the front contributing only 4% of the signal. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a413-v12-19","title":"低反射率量測與背面陷阱：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Low-reflectance metrology and the back-surface trap: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「V-W 反射率附件與背面處理」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “V-W reflectance accessory and back-surface handling” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"同一片試片分別以未處理背面、塗黑背面與楔形試片三種方式量測，確認塗黑後的讀值降到與設計相符的 0.2% 等級且重複性優於 0.03%；以已知反射率的標準片確認光度刻度，並記錄量測光斑大小與入射角。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the same witness three ways, with untreated back, blackened back and as a wedged piece, confirming that the blackened reading drops to the design-level 0.2% with repeatability better than 0.03%; verify the photometric scale with a standard of known reflectance and record the spot size and incidence angle. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：未處理背面就量反射率，4.4% 的讀數讓合格的增透膜被判為失敗而整批重鍍；或用穿透率推算，0.1% 的不確定度把 0.18% 與 0.28% 混為一談，無法分辨製程漂移。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Measuring without treating the back yields 4.4% and condemns a good antireflection batch to recoating; inferring from transmission with 0.1% uncertainty cannot tell 0.18% from 0.28% and hides process drift.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"同一片試片分別以未處理背面、塗黑背面與楔形試片三種方式量測，確認塗黑後的讀值降到與設計相符的 0.2% 等級且重複性優於 0.03%；以已知反射率的標準片確認光度刻度，並記錄量測光斑大小與入射角。","textEn":"Measure the same witness three ways, with untreated back, blackened back and as a wedged piece, confirming that the blackened reading drops to the design-level 0.2% with repeatability better than 0.03%; verify the photometric scale with a standard of known reflectance and record the spot size and incidence angle.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「低反射率量測與背面陷阱」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Low-reflectance metrology and the back-surface trap\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","同一片試片分別以未處理背面、塗黑背面與楔形試片三種方式量測，確認塗黑後的讀值降到與設計相符的 0.2% 等級且重複性優於 0.03%。","半波層對設計波長沒有作用，所以寬帶膜裡的半波層可以省略。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Measure the same witness three ways, with untreated back, blackened back and as a wedged piece, confirming that the blackened reading drops to the design-level 0.2% with repeatability better than 0.03%.","A half-wave layer does nothing at the design wavelength, so it can be dropped from a broadband design."],"answer":1,"explanation":"同一片試片分別以未處理背面、塗黑背面與楔形試片三種方式量測，確認塗黑後的讀值降到與設計相符的 0.2% 等級且重複性優於 0.03%；以已知反射率的標準片確認光度刻度，並記錄量測光斑大小與入射角。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the same witness three ways, with untreated back, blackened back and as a wedged piece, confirming that the blackened reading drops to the design-level 0.2% with repeatability better than 0.03%; verify the photometric scale with a standard of known reflectance and record the spot size and incidence angle. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a413-v12-20","title":"低反射率量測與背面陷阱：失效診斷","titleEn":"Low-reflectance metrology and the back-surface trap: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「V-W 反射率附件與背面處理」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “V-W reflectance accessory and back-surface handling” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"未處理背面就量反射率，4.4% 的讀數讓合格的增透膜被判為失敗而整批重鍍；或用穿透率推算，0.1% 的不確定度把 0.18% 與 0.28% 混為一談，無法分辨製程漂移。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Measuring without treating the back yields 4.4% and condemns a good antireflection batch to recoating; inferring from transmission with 0.1% uncertainty cannot tell 0.18% from 0.28% and hides process drift. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：絕對反射率需要 V-W 型附件，用同一面鏡子在兩種幾何下的比值消去鏡面反射率；光度刻度則以 NIST 可追溯的反射率標準校正。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Absolute reflectance needs a V-W accessory, where the ratio of two geometries with the same mirror cancels the mirror's reflectance, and the photometric scale is calibrated with NIST-traceable reflectance standards.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「分光光度計讀到的反射率就是鍍膜面的反射率。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The reflectance the spectrophotometer reads is the coated surface's reflectance.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"未處理背面就量反射率，4.4% 的讀數讓合格的增透膜被判為失敗而整批重鍍；或用穿透率推算，0.1% 的不確定度把 0.18% 與 0.28% 混為一談，無法分辨製程漂移。","textEn":"Measuring without treating the back yields 4.4% and condemns a good antireflection batch to recoating; inferring from transmission with 0.1% uncertainty cannot tell 0.18% from 0.28% and hides process drift.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「低反射率量測與背面陷阱」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Low-reflectance metrology and the back-surface trap\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","增透膜對入射角不敏感，正向量測合格就能用在任何角度。","未處理背面就量反射率，4.4% 的讀數讓合格的增透膜被判為失敗而整批重鍍。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Antireflection films are insensitive to incidence angle, so passing at normal incidence qualifies any angle.","Measuring without treating the back yields 4.4% and condemns a good antireflection batch to recoating."],"answer":2,"explanation":"未處理背面就量反射率，4.4% 的讀數讓合格的增透膜被判為失敗而整批重鍍；或用穿透率推算，0.1% 的不確定度把 0.18% 與 0.28% 混為一談，無法分辨製程漂移。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Measuring without treating the back yields 4.4% and condemns a good antireflection batch to recoating; inferring from transmission with 0.1% uncertainty cannot tell 0.18% from 0.28% and hides process drift. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a413-v12-21","title":"入射角、偏振與厚度公差：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Incidence angle, polarization and thickness tolerance: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「入射角與厚度誤差的敏感度表」如何決定增透膜設計與沉積的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Sensitivity table for angle and thickness error” determines the key performance of “Antireflection coating design and deposition”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"增透膜在斜入射時有兩個效應：各層有效光學厚度隨 cosθ 縮短使最低點向短波移動，以及 s 與 p 偏振的導納分離使兩者的殘餘反射率不再相同，s 偏振通常惡化得更快。V 膜因為頻寬窄，對角度與厚度誤差都比寬帶膜敏感；寬帶膜在 30° 內仍能維持接近正向的平均反射率。公差分析要把製程厚度散佈、折射率散佈與使用角度範圍一起放進蒙地卡羅，算出平均反射率的分佈，而不是只看設計點。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「入射角與厚度誤差的敏感度表」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"At oblique incidence an antireflection film shows two effects: each layer's effective optical thickness shrinks with cosθ, moving the minimum to shorter wavelengths, and the admittances for s and p polarization separate so their residual reflectances differ, with s usually degrading faster. A V-coat, being narrow, is more sensitive to both angle and thickness error than a broadband design, which keeps near-normal average reflectance out to about 30°. Tolerance analysis must put the process thickness spread, index spread and the range of use angles together into a Monte-Carlo run and report the distribution of average reflectance, not just the design point. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Sensitivity table for angle and thickness error”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：矩陣計算（550 nm V 膜）：兩層同時薄 5% 時 R 由 0.18% 升到 0.27%，薄 13% 時升到 0.72%。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Matrix results for the 550 nm V-coat: with both layers 5% thin, R rises from 0.18% to 0.27%, and 13% thin to 0.72%.","failure":"常見誤解：「增透膜對入射角不敏感，正向量測合格就能用在任何角度。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Antireflection films are insensitive to incidence angle, so passing at normal incidence qualifies any angle.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「入射角與厚度誤差的敏感度表」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Sensitivity table for angle and thickness error”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-21-k1","title":"入射角、偏振與厚度公差","titleEn":"Incidence angle, polarization and thickness tolerance","text":"增透膜在斜入射時有兩個效應：各層有效光學厚度隨 cosθ 縮短使最低點向短波移動，以及 s 與 p 偏振的導納分離使兩者的殘餘反射率不再相同，s 偏振通常惡化得更快。V 膜因為頻寬窄，對角度與厚度誤差都比寬帶膜敏感；寬帶膜在 30° 內仍能維持接近正向的平均反射率。","textEn":"At oblique incidence an antireflection film shows two effects: each layer's effective optical thickness shrinks with cosθ, moving the minimum to shorter wavelengths, and the admittances for s and p polarization separate so their residual reflectances differ, with s usually degrading faster. A V-coat, being narrow, is more sensitive to both angle and thickness error than a broadband design, which keeps near-normal average reflectance out to about 30°.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：增透膜對入射角不敏感，正向量測合格就能用在任何角度。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Antireflection films are insensitive to incidence angle, so passing at normal incidence qualifies any angle. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「入射角、偏振與厚度公差」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Incidence angle, polarization and thickness tolerance\" is correct?","options":["增透膜在斜入射時有兩個效應：各層有效光學厚度隨 cosθ 縮短使最低點向短波移動，以及 s 與 p 偏振的導納分離使兩者的殘餘反射率不再相同，s 偏振通常惡化得更快。","增透膜對入射角不敏感，正向量測合格就能用在任何角度。","透鏡在腔內轉動，膜厚在整個曲面上自然均勻。"],"optionsEn":["At oblique incidence an antireflection film shows two effects: each layer's effective optical thickness shrinks with cosθ, moving the minimum to shorter wavelengths, and the admittances for s and p polarization separate so their residual reflectances differ, with s usually degrading faster.","Antireflection films are insensitive to incidence angle, so passing at normal incidence qualifies any angle.","Because the lens rotates in the chamber the film is naturally uniform over the whole curved surface."],"answer":0,"explanation":"增透膜在斜入射時有兩個效應：各層有效光學厚度隨 cosθ 縮短使最低點向短波移動，以及 s 與 p 偏振的導納分離使兩者的殘餘反射率不再相同，s 偏振通常惡化得更快。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"At oblique incidence an antireflection film shows two effects: each layer's effective optical thickness shrinks with cosθ, moving the minimum to shorter wavelengths, and the admittances for s and p polarization separate so their residual reflectances differ, with s usually degrading faster. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a413-v12-22","title":"入射角、偏振與厚度公差：定量估算","titleEn":"Incidence angle, polarization and thickness tolerance: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「入射角與厚度誤差的敏感度表」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Sensitivity table for angle and thickness error” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：矩陣計算（550 nm V 膜）：兩層同時薄 5% 時 R 由 0.18% 升到 0.27%，薄 13% 時升到 0.72%。角度：15° 時 R_s = 0.24%、R_p = 0.15%；30° 時 R_s = 0.61%、R_p = 0.13%，平均 0.37%；45° 時 R_s = 2.27%、R_p = 0.20%，平均 1.23%。三層寬帶膜 400 到 700 nm 平均：0° 為 0.20%、30° 為 0.31%、45° 為 0.99%。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Matrix results for the 550 nm V-coat: with both layers 5% thin, R rises from 0.18% to 0.27%, and 13% thin to 0.72%. Angle: at 15°, R_s = 0.24% and R_p = 0.15%; at 30°, R_s = 0.61% and R_p = 0.13%, average 0.37%; at 45°, R_s = 2.27% and R_p = 0.20%, average 1.23%. The three-layer broadband design averages 0.20% at 0°, 0.31% at 30° and 0.99% at 45° over 400 to 700 nm. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在分光光度計的可變角附件上以 s、p 偏振片量 0°、15°、30°、45° 的反射率光譜，與矩陣計算逐點比較，差異應在 0.05% 內；把鏡頭設計中每個面的主光線入射角範圍列表，對照角度敏感度表決定哪些面需要寬帶膜、哪些可用 V 膜。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure reflectance spectra at 0°, 15°, 30° and 45° with s and p polarizers on a variable-angle accessory and compare point by point with the matrix calculation, expecting agreement within 0.05%; tabulate the chief-ray incidence-angle range on every surface of the lens design and use the angle-sensitivity table to decide which surfaces need broadband films and which can take a V-coat.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"矩陣計算（550 nm V 膜）：兩層同時薄 5% 時 R 由 0.18% 升到 0.27%，薄 13% 時升到 0.72%。角度：15° 時 R_s = 0.24%、R_p = 0.15%；30° 時 R_s = 0.61%、R_p = 0.13%，平均 0.37%；45° 時 R_s = 2.27%、R_p = 0.20%，平均 1.23%。三層寬帶膜 400 到 700 nm 平均：0° 為 0.20%、30° 為 0.31%、45° 為 0.99%。","textEn":"Matrix results for the 550 nm V-coat: with both layers 5% thin, R rises from 0.18% to 0.27%, and 13% thin to 0.72%. Angle: at 15°, R_s = 0.24% and R_p = 0.15%; at 30°, R_s = 0.61% and R_p = 0.13%, average 0.37%; at 45°, R_s = 2.27% and R_p = 0.20%, average 1.23%. The three-layer broadband design averages 0.20% at 0°, 0.31% at 30° and 0.99% at 45° over 400 to 700 nm.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「入射角、偏振與厚度公差」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Incidence angle, polarization and thickness tolerance\", which statement holds?","options":["一片鏡片只損失 4%，所以整支鏡頭不鍍膜也只差幾個百分點。","矩陣計算（550 nm V 膜）：兩層同時薄 5% 時 R 由 0.18% 升到 0.27%，薄 13% 時升到 0.72%。","半波層對設計波長沒有作用，所以寬帶膜裡的半波層可以省略。"],"optionsEn":["One element loses only 4%, so an uncoated lens is only a few percent worse overall.","Matrix results for the 550 nm V-coat: with both layers 5% thin, R rises from 0.18% to 0.27%, and 13% thin to 0.72%.","A half-wave layer does nothing at the design wavelength, so it can be dropped from a broadband design."],"answer":1,"explanation":"矩陣計算（550 nm V 膜）：兩層同時薄 5% 時 R 由 0.18% 升到 0.27%，薄 13% 時升到 0.72%。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Matrix results for the 550 nm V-coat: with both layers 5% thin, R rises from 0.18% to 0.27%, and 13% thin to 0.72%. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a413-v12-23","title":"入射角、偏振與厚度公差：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Incidence angle, polarization and thickness tolerance: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「入射角與厚度誤差的敏感度表」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Sensitivity table for angle and thickness error” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在分光光度計的可變角附件上以 s、p 偏振片量 0°、15°、30°、45° 的反射率光譜，與矩陣計算逐點比較，差異應在 0.05% 內；把鏡頭設計中每個面的主光線入射角範圍列表，對照角度敏感度表決定哪些面需要寬帶膜、哪些可用 V 膜。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure reflectance spectra at 0°, 15°, 30° and 45° with s and p polarizers on a variable-angle accessory and compare point by point with the matrix calculation, expecting agreement within 0.05%; tabulate the chief-ray incidence-angle range on every surface of the lens design and use the angle-sensitivity table to decide which surfaces need broadband films and which can take a V-coat. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：在 0° 驗證合格的 V 膜被用在 40° 入射的分光面，s 偏振殘餘反射超過 1.5%，系統的偏振相關損耗與鬼影同時超標；厚度控制僅 ±5% 的製程生產 V 膜，批次中心波長散佈 ±27 nm，一半的產品在雷射波長上反射率超過 0.3%。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A V-coat verified at 0° used on a surface at 40° incidence leaves more than 1.5% s-polarized residual, failing polarization-dependent loss and ghost limits together; producing V-coats with only ±5% thickness control scatters batch centre wavelengths by ±27 nm so half the parts exceed 0.3% at the laser line.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在分光光度計的可變角附件上以 s、p 偏振片量 0°、15°、30°、45° 的反射率光譜，與矩陣計算逐點比較，差異應在 0.05% 內；把鏡頭設計中每個面的主光線入射角範圍列表，對照角度敏感度表決定哪些面需要寬帶膜、哪些可用 V 膜。","textEn":"Measure reflectance spectra at 0°, 15°, 30° and 45° with s and p polarizers on a variable-angle accessory and compare point by point with the matrix calculation, expecting agreement within 0.05%; tabulate the chief-ray incidence-angle range on every surface of the lens design and use the angle-sensitivity table to decide which surfaces need broadband films and which can take a V-coat.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「入射角、偏振與厚度公差」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Incidence angle, polarization and thickness tolerance\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","同一種膜材無論怎麼鍍，折射率與耐久性都一樣。","在分光光度計的可變角附件上以 s、p 偏振片量 0°、15°、30°、45° 的反射率光譜，與矩陣計算逐點比較，差異應在 0.05% 內。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","A given material has the same index and durability however it is deposited.","Measure reflectance spectra at 0°, 15°, 30° and 45° with s and p polarizers on a variable-angle accessory and compare point by point with the matrix calculation, expecting agreement within 0.05%."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在分光光度計的可變角附件上以 s、p 偏振片量 0°、15°、30°、45° 的反射率光譜，與矩陣計算逐點比較，差異應在 0.05% 內；把鏡頭設計中每個面的主光線入射角範圍列表，對照角度敏感度表決定哪些面需要寬帶膜、哪些可用 V 膜。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure reflectance spectra at 0°, 15°, 30° and 45° with s and p polarizers on a variable-angle accessory and compare point by point with the matrix calculation, expecting agreement within 0.05%; tabulate the chief-ray incidence-angle range on every surface of the lens design and use the angle-sensitivity table to decide which surfaces need broadband films and which can take a V-coat. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a413-v12-24","title":"入射角、偏振與厚度公差：失效診斷","titleEn":"Incidence angle, polarization and thickness tolerance: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「入射角與厚度誤差的敏感度表」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Sensitivity table for angle and thickness error” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"在 0° 驗證合格的 V 膜被用在 40° 入射的分光面，s 偏振殘餘反射超過 1.5%，系統的偏振相關損耗與鬼影同時超標；厚度控制僅 ±5% 的製程生產 V 膜，批次中心波長散佈 ±27 nm，一半的產品在雷射波長上反射率超過 0.3%。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A V-coat verified at 0° used on a surface at 40° incidence leaves more than 1.5% s-polarized residual, failing polarization-dependent loss and ghost limits together; producing V-coats with only ±5% thickness control scatters batch centre wavelengths by ±27 nm so half the parts exceed 0.3% at the laser line. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：公差分析要把製程厚度散佈、折射率散佈與使用角度範圍一起放進蒙地卡羅，算出平均反射率的分佈，而不是只看設計點。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Tolerance analysis must put the process thickness spread, index spread and the range of use angles together into a Monte-Carlo run and report the distribution of average reflectance, not just the design point.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「增透膜對入射角不敏感，正向量測合格就能用在任何角度。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Antireflection films are insensitive to incidence angle, so passing at normal incidence qualifies any angle.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"在 0° 驗證合格的 V 膜被用在 40° 入射的分光面，s 偏振殘餘反射超過 1.5%，系統的偏振相關損耗與鬼影同時超標；厚度控制僅 ±5% 的製程生產 V 膜，批次中心波長散佈 ±27 nm，一半的產品在雷射波長上反射率超過 0.3%。","textEn":"A V-coat verified at 0° used on a surface at 40° incidence leaves more than 1.5% s-polarized residual, failing polarization-dependent loss and ghost limits together; producing V-coats with only ±5% thickness control scatters batch centre wavelengths by ±27 nm so half the parts exceed 0.3% at the laser line.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「入射角、偏振與厚度公差」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Incidence angle, polarization and thickness tolerance\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["在 0° 驗證合格的 V 膜被用在 40° 入射的分光面，s 偏振殘餘反射超過 1.5%，系統的偏振相關損耗與鬼影同時超標。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","透鏡在腔內轉動，膜厚在整個曲面上自然均勻。"],"optionsEn":["A V-coat verified at 0° used on a surface at 40° incidence leaves more than 1.5% s-polarized residual, failing polarization-dependent loss and ghost limits together.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","Because the lens rotates in the chamber the film is naturally uniform over the whole curved surface."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在 0° 驗證合格的 V 膜被用在 40° 入射的分光面，s 偏振殘餘反射超過 1.5%，系統的偏振相關損耗與鬼影同時超標；厚度控制僅 ±5% 的製程生產 V 膜，批次中心波長散佈 ±27 nm，一半的產品在雷射波長上反射率超過 0.3%。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A V-coat verified at 0° used on a surface at 40° incidence leaves more than 1.5% s-polarized residual, failing polarization-dependent loss and ghost limits together; producing V-coats with only ±5% thickness control scatters batch centre wavelengths by ±27 nm so half the parts exceed 0.3% at the laser line. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a413-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「曲面透鏡上的厚度分佈與鏡頭整合」與「規格換算、耐久等級與交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Thickness distribution on curved lenses and lens integration\" and \"Specification conversion, durability class and handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a413-v12-25","title":"曲面透鏡上的厚度分佈與鏡頭整合：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Thickness distribution on curved lenses and lens integration: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「透鏡夾具與邊緣厚度衰減」如何決定增透膜設計與沉積的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Lens fixture and edge thickness fall-off” determines the key performance of “Antireflection coating design and deposition”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"蒸鍍的膜厚與表面相對於蒸氣流的傾角有關，近似隨 cosφ 下降，陡峭透鏡的邊緣會比中心薄；增透膜的最低點因此在邊緣向短波移動，殘餘反射率沿口徑變化。夾具設計用傾斜的鏡片座、遮罩或把鏡片放在行星轉架的特定半徑來補償，或把設計中心波長略向長波偏移讓邊緣落回波段內。整合到鏡頭時還要處理膠合面（膠的折射率接近玻璃，反射率只有萬分之幾，不需鍍膜）、邊緣塗黑以吸收內反射，以及雷射系統中增透膜的損傷門檻。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「透鏡夾具與邊緣厚度衰減」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Evaporated thickness depends on the surface tilt relative to the vapour stream, falling roughly as cosφ, so the rim of a steep lens receives less than the centre; the antireflection minimum therefore shifts to shorter wavelengths at the rim and the residual varies across the aperture. Fixture design compensates with tilted lens seats, masks or placement at a chosen planetary radius, or the design centre is biased slightly to longer wavelengths so the rim falls back into band. Integration into the lens also handles cemented interfaces, where the cement index is close to glass and reflectance is only a few parts in ten thousand with no coating needed, edge blackening to absorb internal reflections, and, in laser systems, the damage threshold of the antireflection film. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Lens fixture and edge thickness fall-off”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：邊緣法線與蒸氣流夾角 φ = 30° 的透鏡，邊緣厚度 ≈ cos30° ≈ 0.87 倍中心厚度，即薄 13%；550 nm V 膜在邊緣的最低點移到約 480 nm，550 nm 的殘餘反射率由 0.18% 升到 0.72%（矩陣計算）。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For a lens whose rim normal makes φ = 30° with the vapour stream, rim thickness ≈ cos30° ≈ 0.87 of centre, 13% thin; the 550 nm V-coat's minimum at the rim moves to about 480 nm and the 550 nm residual rises from 0.18% to 0.72% (matrix calculation).","failure":"常見誤解：「透鏡在腔內轉動，膜厚在整個曲面上自然均勻。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Because the lens rotates in the chamber the film is naturally uniform over the whole curved surface.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「透鏡夾具與邊緣厚度衰減」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Lens fixture and edge thickness fall-off”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-25-k1","title":"曲面透鏡上的厚度分佈與鏡頭整合","titleEn":"Thickness distribution on curved lenses and lens integration","text":"蒸鍍的膜厚與表面相對於蒸氣流的傾角有關，近似隨 cosφ 下降，陡峭透鏡的邊緣會比中心薄；增透膜的最低點因此在邊緣向短波移動，殘餘反射率沿口徑變化。夾具設計用傾斜的鏡片座、遮罩或把鏡片放在行星轉架的特定半徑來補償，或把設計中心波長略向長波偏移讓邊緣落回波段內。","textEn":"Evaporated thickness depends on the surface tilt relative to the vapour stream, falling roughly as cosφ, so the rim of a steep lens receives less than the centre; the antireflection minimum therefore shifts to shorter wavelengths at the rim and the residual varies across the aperture. Fixture design compensates with tilted lens seats, masks or placement at a chosen planetary radius, or the design centre is biased slightly to longer wavelengths so the rim falls back into band.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：透鏡在腔內轉動，膜厚在整個曲面上自然均勻。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Because the lens rotates in the chamber the film is naturally uniform over the whole curved surface. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「曲面透鏡上的厚度分佈與鏡頭整合」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Thickness distribution on curved lenses and lens integration\" is correct?","options":["透鏡在腔內轉動，膜厚在整個曲面上自然均勻。","蒸鍍的膜厚與表面相對於蒸氣流的傾角有關，近似隨 cosφ 下降，陡峭透鏡的邊緣會比中心薄；增透膜的最低點因此在邊緣向短波移動，殘餘反射率沿口徑變化。","增透膜越透明越好，規格只需要一個反射率上限。"],"optionsEn":["Because the lens rotates in the chamber the film is naturally uniform over the whole curved surface.","Evaporated thickness depends on the surface tilt relative to the vapour stream, falling roughly as cosφ, so the rim of a steep lens receives less than the centre.","An antireflection film only needs to be as transparent as possible, so one reflectance ceiling is specification enough."],"answer":1,"explanation":"蒸鍍的膜厚與表面相對於蒸氣流的傾角有關，近似隨 cosφ 下降，陡峭透鏡的邊緣會比中心薄；增透膜的最低點因此在邊緣向短波移動，殘餘反射率沿口徑變化。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Evaporated thickness depends on the surface tilt relative to the vapour stream, falling roughly as cosφ, so the rim of a steep lens receives less than the centre; the antireflection minimum therefore shifts to shorter wavelengths at the rim and the residual varies across the aperture. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a413-v12-26","title":"曲面透鏡上的厚度分佈與鏡頭整合：定量估算","titleEn":"Thickness distribution on curved lenses and lens integration: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「透鏡夾具與邊緣厚度衰減」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Lens fixture and edge thickness fall-off” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：邊緣法線與蒸氣流夾角 φ = 30° 的透鏡，邊緣厚度 ≈ cos30° ≈ 0.87 倍中心厚度，即薄 13%；550 nm V 膜在邊緣的最低點移到約 480 nm，550 nm 的殘餘反射率由 0.18% 升到 0.72%（矩陣計算）。膠合面：n = 1.52 與 n = 1.56 的玻璃以 n = 1.54 的膠黏合，各界面 R ≈ [(0.02)/(3.06)]² ≈ 4×10⁻⁵，遠低於任何增透膜。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For a lens whose rim normal makes φ = 30° with the vapour stream, rim thickness ≈ cos30° ≈ 0.87 of centre, 13% thin; the 550 nm V-coat's minimum at the rim moves to about 480 nm and the 550 nm residual rises from 0.18% to 0.72% (matrix calculation). Cemented interface: glasses of n = 1.52 and 1.56 bonded with n = 1.54 cement reflect R ≈ [(0.02)/(3.06)]² ≈ 4×10⁻⁵ at each interface, far below any antireflection film. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在同一片透鏡的中心與邊緣以小光斑反射率附件各量一次，比較最低點波長的位移與 cosφ 模型；在夾具不同半徑放平面見證片，繪出厚度對位置的曲線，調整傾角或遮罩直到邊緣位移小於 3%；鏡頭組裝後量整體穿透率與鬼影，核對整合預算。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the lens centre and rim with a small-spot reflectance accessory and compare the minimum-wavelength shift with the cosφ model; place flat witnesses at several fixture radii, plot thickness against position and adjust tilt or masks until the rim shift is below 3%; after assembly measure total transmission and ghosts to close the integration budget.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"邊緣法線與蒸氣流夾角 φ = 30° 的透鏡，邊緣厚度 ≈ cos30° ≈ 0.87 倍中心厚度，即薄 13%；550 nm V 膜在邊緣的最低點移到約 480 nm，550 nm 的殘餘反射率由 0.18% 升到 0.72%（矩陣計算）。膠合面：n = 1.52 與 n = 1.56 的玻璃以 n = 1.54 的膠黏合，各界面 R ≈ [(0.02)/(3.06)]² ≈ 4×10⁻⁵，遠低於任何增透膜。","textEn":"For a lens whose rim normal makes φ = 30° with the vapour stream, rim thickness ≈ cos30° ≈ 0.87 of centre, 13% thin; the 550 nm V-coat's minimum at the rim moves to about 480 nm and the 550 nm residual rises from 0.18% to 0.72% (matrix calculation). Cemented interface: glasses of n = 1.52 and 1.56 bonded with n = 1.54 cement reflect R ≈ [(0.02)/(3.06)]² ≈ 4×10⁻⁵ at each interface, far below any antireflection film.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「曲面透鏡上的厚度分佈與鏡頭整合」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Thickness distribution on curved lenses and lens integration\", which statement holds?","options":["增透膜就是鍍一層折射率低於玻璃的材料，越低越好，厚度不重要。","同一種膜材無論怎麼鍍，折射率與耐久性都一樣。","邊緣法線與蒸氣流夾角 φ = 30° 的透鏡，邊緣厚度 ≈ cos30° ≈ 0.87 倍中心厚度，即薄 13%。"],"optionsEn":["An antireflection film is just a layer of index lower than glass, the lower the better, with thickness unimportant.","A given material has the same index and durability however it is deposited.","For a lens whose rim normal makes φ = 30° with the vapour stream, rim thickness ≈ cos30° ≈ 0.87 of centre, 13% thin."],"answer":2,"explanation":"邊緣法線與蒸氣流夾角 φ = 30° 的透鏡，邊緣厚度 ≈ cos30° ≈ 0.87 倍中心厚度，即薄 13%；550 nm V 膜在邊緣的最低點移到約 480 nm，550 nm 的殘餘反射率由 0.18% 升到 0.72%（矩陣計算）。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For a lens whose rim normal makes φ = 30° with the vapour stream, rim thickness ≈ cos30° ≈ 0.87 of centre, 13% thin; the 550 nm V-coat's minimum at the rim moves to about 480 nm and the 550 nm residual rises from 0.18% to 0.72% (matrix calculation). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a413-v12-27","title":"曲面透鏡上的厚度分佈與鏡頭整合：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Thickness distribution on curved lenses and lens integration: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「透鏡夾具與邊緣厚度衰減」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Lens fixture and edge thickness fall-off” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在同一片透鏡的中心與邊緣以小光斑反射率附件各量一次，比較最低點波長的位移與 cosφ 模型；在夾具不同半徑放平面見證片，繪出厚度對位置的曲線，調整傾角或遮罩直到邊緣位移小於 3%；鏡頭組裝後量整體穿透率與鬼影，核對整合預算。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the lens centre and rim with a small-spot reflectance accessory and compare the minimum-wavelength shift with the cosφ model; place flat witnesses at several fixture radii, plot thickness against position and adjust tilt or masks until the rim shift is below 3%; after assembly measure total transmission and ghosts to close the integration budget. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：陡峭非球面以平放的夾具鍍 V 膜，邊緣最低點偏到 480 nm，在雷射波長邊緣環帶反射率 0.7%，形成環狀鬼影；或在膠合面上多鍍增透膜，反而因膠與膜的折射率差增加反射並造成膠合應力。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A steep asphere coated flat in the fixture gets its rim minimum at 480 nm, a 0.7% rim annulus at the laser wavelength and a ring ghost; adding an antireflection film to a cemented interface raises reflection through the index step between cement and film and stresses the bond.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在同一片透鏡的中心與邊緣以小光斑反射率附件各量一次，比較最低點波長的位移與 cosφ 模型；在夾具不同半徑放平面見證片，繪出厚度對位置的曲線，調整傾角或遮罩直到邊緣位移小於 3%；鏡頭組裝後量整體穿透率與鬼影，核對整合預算。","textEn":"Measure the lens centre and rim with a small-spot reflectance accessory and compare the minimum-wavelength shift with the cosφ model; place flat witnesses at several fixture radii, plot thickness against position and adjust tilt or masks until the rim shift is below 3%; after assembly measure total transmission and ghosts to close the integration budget.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「曲面透鏡上的厚度分佈與鏡頭整合」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Thickness distribution on curved lenses and lens integration\"?","options":["在同一片透鏡的中心與邊緣以小光斑反射率附件各量一次，比較最低點波長的位移與 cosφ 模型。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","分光光度計讀到的反射率就是鍍膜面的反射率。"],"optionsEn":["Measure the lens centre and rim with a small-spot reflectance accessory and compare the minimum-wavelength shift with the cosφ model.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","The reflectance the spectrophotometer reads is the coated surface's reflectance."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在同一片透鏡的中心與邊緣以小光斑反射率附件各量一次，比較最低點波長的位移與 cosφ 模型；在夾具不同半徑放平面見證片，繪出厚度對位置的曲線，調整傾角或遮罩直到邊緣位移小於 3%；鏡頭組裝後量整體穿透率與鬼影，核對整合預算。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the lens centre and rim with a small-spot reflectance accessory and compare the minimum-wavelength shift with the cosφ model; place flat witnesses at several fixture radii, plot thickness against position and adjust tilt or masks until the rim shift is below 3%; after assembly measure total transmission and ghosts to close the integration budget. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a413-v12-28","title":"曲面透鏡上的厚度分佈與鏡頭整合：失效診斷","titleEn":"Thickness distribution on curved lenses and lens integration: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「透鏡夾具與邊緣厚度衰減」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Lens fixture and edge thickness fall-off” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"陡峭非球面以平放的夾具鍍 V 膜，邊緣最低點偏到 480 nm，在雷射波長邊緣環帶反射率 0.7%，形成環狀鬼影；或在膠合面上多鍍增透膜，反而因膠與膜的折射率差增加反射並造成膠合應力。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A steep asphere coated flat in the fixture gets its rim minimum at 480 nm, a 0.7% rim annulus at the laser wavelength and a ring ghost; adding an antireflection film to a cemented interface raises reflection through the index step between cement and film and stresses the bond. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：整合到鏡頭時還要處理膠合面（膠的折射率接近玻璃，反射率只有萬分之幾，不需鍍膜）、邊緣塗黑以吸收內反射，以及雷射系統中增透膜的損傷門檻。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Integration into the lens also handles cemented interfaces, where the cement index is close to glass and reflectance is only a few parts in ten thousand with no coating needed, edge blackening to absorb internal reflections, and, in laser systems, the damage threshold of the antireflection film.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「透鏡在腔內轉動，膜厚在整個曲面上自然均勻。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Because the lens rotates in the chamber the film is naturally uniform over the whole curved surface.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"陡峭非球面以平放的夾具鍍 V 膜，邊緣最低點偏到 480 nm，在雷射波長邊緣環帶反射率 0.7%，形成環狀鬼影；或在膠合面上多鍍增透膜，反而因膠與膜的折射率差增加反射並造成膠合應力。","textEn":"A steep asphere coated flat in the fixture gets its rim minimum at 480 nm, a 0.7% rim annulus at the laser wavelength and a ring ghost; adding an antireflection film to a cemented interface raises reflection through the index step between cement and film and stresses the bond.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「曲面透鏡上的厚度分佈與鏡頭整合」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Thickness distribution on curved lenses and lens integration\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","陡峭非球面以平放的夾具鍍 V 膜，邊緣最低點偏到 480 nm，在雷射波長邊緣環帶反射率 0.7%，形成環狀鬼影。","增透膜越透明越好，規格只需要一個反射率上限。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","A steep asphere coated flat in the fixture gets its rim minimum at 480 nm, a 0.7% rim annulus at the laser wavelength and a ring ghost.","An antireflection film only needs to be as transparent as possible, so one reflectance ceiling is specification enough."],"answer":1,"explanation":"陡峭非球面以平放的夾具鍍 V 膜，邊緣最低點偏到 480 nm，在雷射波長邊緣環帶反射率 0.7%，形成環狀鬼影；或在膠合面上多鍍增透膜，反而因膠與膜的折射率差增加反射並造成膠合應力。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A steep asphere coated flat in the fixture gets its rim minimum at 480 nm, a 0.7% rim annulus at the laser wavelength and a ring ghost; adding an antireflection film to a cemented interface raises reflection through the index step between cement and film and stresses the bond. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a413-v12-29","title":"規格換算、耐久等級與交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Specification conversion, durability class and handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「增透膜規格表與鏡頭穿透率預算」如何決定增透膜設計與沉積的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Antireflection specification sheet and lens transmission budget” determines the key performance of “Antireflection coating design and deposition”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"增透膜的規格應寫成「在指定波段與角度範圍內的平均與最大反射率」，並註明單面或雙面、基板折射率、偏振，以及耐久等級：依 ISO 9211 或軍規的磨耗、附著、濕熱與鹽霧序列。驗收時用塗黑背面的見證片量反射率，並把每面的實測值代回系統模型計算鏡頭穿透率與主要鬼影，與系統預算比較。交接資料包括各面的膜型（V 膜或寬帶）、設計波長、見證片光譜、耐久測試結果與批號，使鏡頭裝配與雷射系統端能追溯每個面的狀態與清潔方式限制。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「增透膜規格表與鏡頭穿透率預算」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"An antireflection specification should read as average and maximum reflectance within a stated band and angle range, with single- or double-sided, substrate index, polarization and durability class per ISO 9211 or military abrasion, adhesion, humidity and salt-fog sequences. Acceptance measures witnesses with blackened backs and feeds each surface's measured value back into the system model to compute lens transmission and the main ghosts against the system budget. The handoff lists each surface's film type (V-coat or broadband), design wavelength, witness spectrum, durability results and batch number so lens assembly and laser-system users can trace every surface's state and cleaning limits. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Antireflection specification sheet and lens transmission budget”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：十片鏡頭、二十面，其中十六面鍍寬帶膜平均 0.25%，四面陡峭面因邊緣效應取 0.5%：穿透率 ≈ 0.9975¹⁶ × 0.995⁴ ≈ 0.961 × 0.980 ≈ 0.942，再乘玻璃內部吸收 0.98 得 0.92，若系統預算要求 ≥ 0.90 則合格。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A ten-element lens with twenty surfaces, sixteen coated broadband at 0.25% average and four steep surfaces taken at 0.5% for rim effects: transmission ≈ 0.9975¹⁶ × 0.995⁴ ≈ 0.961 × 0.980 ≈ 0.942, times 0.98 for internal glass absorption gives 0.92, passing a system budget of ≥ 0.90.","failure":"常見誤解：「增透膜越透明越好，規格只需要一個反射率上限。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"An antireflection film only needs to be as transparent as possible, so one reflectance ceiling is specification enough.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「增透膜規格表與鏡頭穿透率預算」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Antireflection specification sheet and lens transmission budget”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-29-k1","title":"規格換算、耐久等級與交接","titleEn":"Specification conversion, durability class and handoff","text":"增透膜的規格應寫成「在指定波段與角度範圍內的平均與最大反射率」，並註明單面或雙面、基板折射率、偏振，以及耐久等級：依 ISO 9211 或軍規的磨耗、附著、濕熱與鹽霧序列。驗收時用塗黑背面的見證片量反射率，並把每面的實測值代回系統模型計算鏡頭穿透率與主要鬼影，與系統預算比較。","textEn":"An antireflection specification should read as average and maximum reflectance within a stated band and angle range, with single- or double-sided, substrate index, polarization and durability class per ISO 9211 or military abrasion, adhesion, humidity and salt-fog sequences. Acceptance measures witnesses with blackened backs and feeds each surface's measured value back into the system model to compute lens transmission and the main ghosts against the system budget.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：增透膜越透明越好，規格只需要一個反射率上限。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: An antireflection film only needs to be as transparent as possible, so one reflectance ceiling is specification enough. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「規格換算、耐久等級與交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Specification conversion, durability class and handoff\" is correct?","options":["增透膜越透明越好，規格只需要一個反射率上限。","一片鏡片只損失 4%，所以整支鏡頭不鍍膜也只差幾個百分點。","增透膜的規格應寫成「在指定波段與角度範圍內的平均與最大反射率」，並註明單面或雙面、基板折射率、偏振，以及耐久等級：依 ISO 9211 或軍規的磨耗、附著、濕熱與鹽霧序列。"],"optionsEn":["An antireflection film only needs to be as transparent as possible, so one reflectance ceiling is specification enough.","One element loses only 4%, so an uncoated lens is only a few percent worse overall.","An antireflection specification should read as average and maximum reflectance within a stated band and angle range, with single- or double-sided, substrate index, polarization and durability class per ISO 9211 or military abrasion, adhesion, humidity and salt-fog sequences."],"answer":2,"explanation":"增透膜的規格應寫成「在指定波段與角度範圍內的平均與最大反射率」，並註明單面或雙面、基板折射率、偏振，以及耐久等級：依 ISO 9211 或軍規的磨耗、附著、濕熱與鹽霧序列。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"An antireflection specification should read as average and maximum reflectance within a stated band and angle range, with single- or double-sided, substrate index, polarization and durability class per ISO 9211 or military abrasion, adhesion, humidity and salt-fog sequences. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a413-v12-30","title":"規格換算、耐久等級與交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Specification conversion, durability class and handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「增透膜規格表與鏡頭穿透率預算」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Antireflection specification sheet and lens transmission budget” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：十片鏡頭、二十面，其中十六面鍍寬帶膜平均 0.25%，四面陡峭面因邊緣效應取 0.5%：穿透率 ≈ 0.9975¹⁶ × 0.995⁴ ≈ 0.961 × 0.980 ≈ 0.942，再乘玻璃內部吸收 0.98 得 0.92，若系統預算要求 ≥ 0.90 則合格。最亮鬼影來自兩個 0.5% 的面：2.5×10⁻⁵，相對未鍍膜的 1.8×10⁻³ 下降 72 倍，符合雜散光預算 ≤ 5×10⁻⁵。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A ten-element lens with twenty surfaces, sixteen coated broadband at 0.25% average and four steep surfaces taken at 0.5% for rim effects: transmission ≈ 0.9975¹⁶ × 0.995⁴ ≈ 0.961 × 0.980 ≈ 0.942, times 0.98 for internal glass absorption gives 0.92, passing a system budget of ≥ 0.90. The brightest ghost comes from two 0.5% surfaces: 2.5×10⁻⁵, 72 times below the uncoated 1.8×10⁻³ and within a stray-light budget of ≤ 5×10⁻⁵. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以第二台分光光度計複測見證片，差異需小於 0.05%；核對規格表每一項（波段、角度、偏振、耐久等級）都有對應量測紀錄；把見證片做完整耐久序列後再量一次光譜，確認平均反射率變化小於 0.1%，並把整支鏡頭的穿透率實測值與預算表並列。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Re-measure witnesses on a second spectrophotometer, requiring agreement within 0.05%; check that every specification line (band, angle, polarization, durability class) has a matching measurement record; run the witnesses through the full durability sequence and re-measure, confirming the average reflectance changes by less than 0.1%, and place the measured lens transmission beside the budget table.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"十片鏡頭、二十面，其中十六面鍍寬帶膜平均 0.25%，四面陡峭面因邊緣效應取 0.5%：穿透率 ≈ 0.9975¹⁶ × 0.995⁴ ≈ 0.961 × 0.980 ≈ 0.942，再乘玻璃內部吸收 0.98 得 0.92，若系統預算要求 ≥ 0.90 則合格。最亮鬼影來自兩個 0.5% 的面：2.5×10⁻⁵，相對未鍍膜的 1.8×10⁻³ 下降 72 倍，符合雜散光預算 ≤ 5×10⁻⁵。","textEn":"A ten-element lens with twenty surfaces, sixteen coated broadband at 0.25% average and four steep surfaces taken at 0.5% for rim effects: transmission ≈ 0.9975¹⁶ × 0.995⁴ ≈ 0.961 × 0.980 ≈ 0.942, times 0.98 for internal glass absorption gives 0.92, passing a system budget of ≥ 0.90. The brightest ghost comes from two 0.5% surfaces: 2.5×10⁻⁵, 72 times below the uncoated 1.8×10⁻³ and within a stray-light budget of ≤ 5×10⁻⁵.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「規格換算、耐久等級與交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Specification conversion, durability class and handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["十片鏡頭、二十面，其中十六面鍍寬帶膜平均 0.25%，四面陡峭面因邊緣效應取 0.5%：穿透率 ≈ 0.9975¹⁶ × 0.995⁴ ≈ 0.961 × 0.980 ≈ 0.942，再乘玻璃內部吸收 0.98 得 0.92，若系統預算要求 ≥ 0.90 則合格。","半波層對設計波長沒有作用，所以寬帶膜裡的半波層可以省略。","分光光度計讀到的反射率就是鍍膜面的反射率。"],"optionsEn":["A ten-element lens with twenty surfaces, sixteen coated broadband at 0.25% average and four steep surfaces taken at 0.5% for rim effects: transmission ≈ 0.9975¹⁶ × 0.995⁴ ≈ 0.961 × 0.980 ≈ 0.942, times 0.98 for internal glass absorption gives 0.92, passing a system budget of ≥ 0.90.","A half-wave layer does nothing at the design wavelength, so it can be dropped from a broadband design.","The reflectance the spectrophotometer reads is the coated surface's reflectance."],"answer":0,"explanation":"十片鏡頭、二十面，其中十六面鍍寬帶膜平均 0.25%，四面陡峭面因邊緣效應取 0.5%：穿透率 ≈ 0.9975¹⁶ × 0.995⁴ ≈ 0.961 × 0.980 ≈ 0.942，再乘玻璃內部吸收 0.98 得 0.92，若系統預算要求 ≥ 0.90 則合格。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A ten-element lens with twenty surfaces, sixteen coated broadband at 0.25% average and four steep surfaces taken at 0.5% for rim effects: transmission ≈ 0.9975¹⁶ × 0.995⁴ ≈ 0.961 × 0.980 ≈ 0.942, times 0.98 for internal glass absorption gives 0.92, passing a system budget of ≥ 0.90. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a413-v12-31","title":"規格換算、耐久等級與交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Specification conversion, durability class and handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「增透膜規格表與鏡頭穿透率預算」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Antireflection specification sheet and lens transmission budget” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以第二台分光光度計複測見證片，差異需小於 0.05%；核對規格表每一項（波段、角度、偏振、耐久等級）都有對應量測紀錄；把見證片做完整耐久序列後再量一次光譜，確認平均反射率變化小於 0.1%，並把整支鏡頭的穿透率實測值與預算表並列。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Re-measure witnesses on a second spectrophotometer, requiring agreement within 0.05%; check that every specification line (band, angle, polarization, durability class) has a matching measurement record; run the witnesses through the full durability sequence and re-measure, confirming the average reflectance changes by less than 0.1%, and place the measured lens transmission beside the budget table. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：規格只寫「R \u003c 0.5%」而未指明波段與角度，供應商在 550 nm 正向交貨合格，鏡頭在 420 nm、35° 的面上殘餘反射 2%，藍光鬼影超標；缺少耐久等級，軟質 MgF₂ 膜被客戶以乾布擦拭後刮花。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A specification reading only R \u003c 0.5% without band or angle passes at 550 nm normal incidence while a surface used at 420 nm and 35° leaves 2% residual and a blue ghost over budget; without a durability class a soft MgF₂ film is scratched when the customer wipes it with a dry cloth.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以第二台分光光度計複測見證片，差異需小於 0.05%；核對規格表每一項（波段、角度、偏振、耐久等級）都有對應量測紀錄；把見證片做完整耐久序列後再量一次光譜，確認平均反射率變化小於 0.1%，並把整支鏡頭的穿透率實測值與預算表並列。","textEn":"Re-measure witnesses on a second spectrophotometer, requiring agreement within 0.05%; check that every specification line (band, angle, polarization, durability class) has a matching measurement record; run the witnesses through the full durability sequence and re-measure, confirming the average reflectance changes by less than 0.1%, and place the measured lens transmission beside the budget table.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「規格換算、耐久等級與交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Specification conversion, durability class and handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","以第二台分光光度計複測見證片，差異需小於 0.05%。","增透膜對入射角不敏感，正向量測合格就能用在任何角度。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Re-measure witnesses on a second spectrophotometer, requiring agreement within 0.05%.","Antireflection films are insensitive to incidence angle, so passing at normal incidence qualifies any angle."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以第二台分光光度計複測見證片，差異需小於 0.05%；核對規格表每一項（波段、角度、偏振、耐久等級）都有對應量測紀錄；把見證片做完整耐久序列後再量一次光譜，確認平均反射率變化小於 0.1%，並把整支鏡頭的穿透率實測值與預算表並列。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Re-measure witnesses on a second spectrophotometer, requiring agreement within 0.05%; check that every specification line (band, angle, polarization, durability class) has a matching measurement record; run the witnesses through the full durability sequence and re-measure, confirming the average reflectance changes by less than 0.1%, and place the measured lens transmission beside the budget table. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a413-v12-32","title":"規格換算、耐久等級與交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Specification conversion, durability class and handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"prerequisiteIds":["a413-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「增透膜規格表與鏡頭穿透率預算」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Antireflection specification sheet and lens transmission budget” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"規格只寫「R \u003c 0.5%」而未指明波段與角度，供應商在 550 nm 正向交貨合格，鏡頭在 420 nm、35° 的面上殘餘反射 2%，藍光鬼影超標；缺少耐久等級，軟質 MgF₂ 膜被客戶以乾布擦拭後刮花。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A specification reading only R \u003c 0.5% without band or angle passes at 550 nm normal incidence while a surface used at 420 nm and 35° leaves 2% residual and a blue ghost over budget; without a durability class a soft MgF₂ film is scratched when the customer wipes it with a dry cloth. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：交接資料包括各面的膜型（V 膜或寬帶）、設計波長、見證片光譜、耐久測試結果與批號，使鏡頭裝配與雷射系統端能追溯每個面的狀態與清潔方式限制。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The handoff lists each surface's film type (V-coat or broadband), design wavelength, witness spectrum, durability results and batch number so lens assembly and laser-system users can trace every surface's state and cleaning limits.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「增透膜越透明越好，規格只需要一個反射率上限。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"An antireflection film only needs to be as transparent as possible, so one reflectance ceiling is specification enough.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a413-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"規格只寫「R \u003c 0.5%」而未指明波段與角度，供應商在 550 nm 正向交貨合格，鏡頭在 420 nm、35° 的面上殘餘反射 2%，藍光鬼影超標；缺少耐久等級，軟質 MgF₂ 膜被客戶以乾布擦拭後刮花。","textEn":"A specification reading only R \u003c 0.5% without band or angle passes at 550 nm normal incidence while a surface used at 420 nm and 35° leaves 2% residual and a blue ghost over budget; without a durability class a soft MgF₂ film is scratched when the customer wipes it with a dry cloth.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]},{"id":"a413-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「規格換算、耐久等級與交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Specification conversion, durability class and handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","一片鏡片只損失 4%，所以整支鏡頭不鍍膜也只差幾個百分點。","規格只寫「R \u003c 0.5%」而未指明波段與角度，供應商在 550 nm 正向交貨合格，鏡頭在 420 nm、35° 的面上殘餘反射 2%，藍光鬼影超標。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","One element loses only 4%, so an uncoated lens is only a few percent worse overall.","A specification reading only R \u003c 0.5% without band or angle passes at 550 nm normal incidence while a surface used at 420 nm and 35° leaves 2% residual and a blue ghost over budget."],"answer":2,"explanation":"規格只寫「R \u003c 0.5%」而未指明波段與角度，供應商在 550 nm 正向交貨合格，鏡頭在 420 nm、35° 的面上殘餘反射 2%，藍光鬼影超標；缺少耐久等級，軟質 MgF₂ 膜被客戶以乾布擦拭後刮花。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A specification reading only R \u003c 0.5% without band or angle passes at 550 nm normal incidence while a surface used at 420 nm and 35° leaves 2% residual and a blue ghost over budget; without a durability class a soft MgF₂ film is scratched when the customer wipes it with a dry cloth. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-ar-coatings","v12o-thorlabs-optical-coatings","v12o-fraunhofer-iof-functional-surfaces"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
